ration into customer IT and C2 environments.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW106817395 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Apply NAF v4 and/or ADMBw architecture frameworks to structure customer-facing and internal solution designs.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW106817395 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Design and govern the full IT-service lifecycle, from requirements through deployment, operations, and decommissioning.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW106817395 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Architect solutions spanning cloud, Kubernetes, and deployable/on-premise environments.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW106817395 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Lead and mentor internal and external architects and technical teams across complex programs.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW106817395 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Apply TOGAF, BPMN, and ITIL practices to structure architecture governance and IT service management processes.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW106817395 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Represent TYTAN's technical architecture to customers, partners, and integrators.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul> <br> <ul><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW180639565 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Defense-sector experience is mandatory; a former military background is strongly preferred.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW180639565 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Practical, hands-on experience with </span><span style="color:#121317">Sparx Enterprise Architect</span>, <span style="color:#000000">NAF v4 and/or ADMBw.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW180639565 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Strong IT, software, or systems architecture background.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW180639565 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">At least 5 years of relevant experience in solution architecture or technical IT consulting.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW180639565 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Experience with TOGAF, BPMN, and ITIL; relevant certifications preferred.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW180639565 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Experience designing complex IT service-management platforms and processes.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW180639565 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Experience with cloud, Kubernetes, and deployable/on-premise environments.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW180639565 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Demonstrated ability to lead internal and external architects and technical teams.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW180639565 BCX8"><span style="color:#000000">Fluent German and English.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h3><strong><span style="color:#121317">Why TYTAN?</span></strong></h3><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Build technology with real operational impact:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> Develop autonomous defense systems designed to protect lives and strengthen Europe’s security</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Shape scalable defense capabilities:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> Work on solutions built for mass deployment, cost efficiency, resilience, and reliable production at scale</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Contribute to networked air defense:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> Help integrate our systems into multi-layered defense architectures alongside sensors, command systems, and effectors</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Develop for real-world operations:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"> Build capabilities together with end users and improve them continuously based on direct operational feedback</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Move fast and take ownership:</span>