<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">If you have spent your career building systems that people initially thought were too difficult, too ambitious or too fast to deliver, we want to hear from you.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div><br><strong>What you'll do </strong><br>
<li>Own the technical integrity of Hypersonica’s flight vehicles from system concept through design, integration, test and flight.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Define and continuously evolve the overall vehicle architecture, ensuring that mission objectives translate into a coherent physical and functional system.&nbsp;</li>
