&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of B2B outbound and inbound prospecting motions and sales engagement tooling, as well as sharp written communication skills with the ability to write and edit high-converting outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with core SDR tools: Salesforce, Outreach or Salesloft, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, ZoomInfo or Apollo; familiarity with AI-powered tools (Gong, Lavender, or similar) a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills across Growth Marketing, Product Marketing, Sales, and Enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven approach to performance management and process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring, ramping, and developing sales development talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background as an individual contributor in crypto, FinTech or B2B software sales preferred&lt;/li&gt;
