rowing toward 100 million.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The audience is already here. The opportunity is what happens next.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re hiring a <strong>Senior Lifecycle Marketing Manager</strong> to take CRM to an entirely new level. Your mission is clear: <strong>turn it into a major revenue channel</strong> by converting more users, increasing repeat purchases, and giving people compelling reasons to keep coming back.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll own everything within CRM, from onboarding and first purchase to retention and reactivation, across email, push notifications, in-product messaging, and promotions.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll report directly to <strong>Thomas Lacroix, our Co-founder and CMO</strong>, with the freedom to rethink journeys, test ambitious ideas, and build the CRM playbook that gets us there.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At our scale, even small improvements can influence millions of user journeys and create significant growth.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>If you’re looking for more than a campaign-management role, this is your opportunity to drive measurable growth at exceptional scale.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Your Responsibilities</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own one of EverAI’s biggest growth opportunities:</strong> lead the strategy and execution across the full CRM lifecycle, from onboarding and conversion through repeat purchasing, retention, and reactivation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Find the growth hiding in our user base:</strong> use behavioral data to uncover where users lose interest, stop engaging, or miss an opportunity to purchase</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Crack the first-purchase challenge:</strong> create onboarding, abandoned-payment, offer, and follow-up journeys that turn more registered users into paying customers</p></li><li><p style="