<li><strong>English proficiency:</strong> Fluent English communication skills for collaborating with the team, discussing concepts, understanding feedback, and documenting creative decisions.</li>
<li><strong>Commercial awareness:</strong> An understanding of how visual design, product differentiation, and customer preferences influence purchasing decisions in e-commerce.</li>

<p><strong>Strongly preferred:</strong></p>

