.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to the development of consistent, scalable HR processes in a growing organization while recognizing the need for locally appropriate practices.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Desired Skills and Experience</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">4+ years of experience in full-cycle recruiting, talent acquisition, and/or HR operations, ideally in a growing technology, energy, engineering, or other technical organization.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated success managing multiple open requisitions and delivering a strong candidate experience.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience recruiting for technical, commercial, operational, or corporate roles; experience in engineering or energy-related hiring is a plus.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with Swiss employment practices and HR administration, or experience supporting employees in Switzerland.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in English; professional proficiency in French is strongly preferred given the location in Nyon and the potential need to support local employees and external partners.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with applicant tracking systems (Ashby preferred), HRIS platforms (HiBob), and standard productivity tools.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong organizational skills and attention to detail, with the ability to manage competing priorities independently.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent interpersonal, written, and verbal communication skills.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><l