&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/swissitsecuritygroup/iam-software-engineer-waardenburg-gelderland-188228","tags":["Software Development"],"job_types":[],"location":"Waardenburg, Gelderland","created_at":1793343318},{"slug":"commercial-account-executive-uk-amsterdam-188057","company_name":"Horizon3Ai","title":"Commercial Account Executive, UK","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Get to Know Us</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Horizon3.ai is a fast-growing, remote cybersecurity company dedicated to the mission of enabling organisations to proactively find and fix and verify exploitable attack vectors before criminals exploit them. Our flagship product,  the NodeZeroTM platform, delivers production-safe autonomous pentests and other key assessment operations that scale across the largest internal, external, cloud, and hybrid cloud environments. NodeZero has been adopted by organisations of all sizes, from small educational institutions to government agencies and Global 100 enterprises. It is used by ITOps/SecOps teams, consulting pentesters, and MSSPs and MSPs.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a fusion of former U.S. Special Operations cyber operators, startup engineers, and formerly frustrated cybersecurity practitioners. We're committed to helping solve our common security problems: ineffective security tools, false positives resulting in alert fatigue, blind spots, "checkbox” security culture, cybersecurity skills shortage, and the long lead time and expense of hiring outside consultants. Collectively, we are a team of learn it alls, committed to a culture of respect, collaboration, ownership, and results.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Role Description</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help shape the next stage of Horizon3.ai’s UK growth. Based in the Netherlands with regular UK travel, you’ll bring autonomous pentesting to new customers and help them reduce real-world security risk. If you thrive on opening doors, building partnerships and turning opportunities into wins, this is a chance to make a visible impact as we expand our UK Commercial team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We currently require our Amsterdam team to come to the office 2 - 3 days per week. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>What You’ll Do</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Grow Horizon3.ai’s UK Commercial business by winning new customers, developing productive channel partnerships and helping organisations realise value from our cybersecurity solutions.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Win new accounts and expand our customer base by introducing disruptive cybersecurity software solutions to the UK market.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and convert a qualified pipeline, owning the sales cycle from qualification and proof of value through negotiation and close, with the goal of exceeding quota consistently quarter over quarter.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn channel partnerships into revenue by proactively engaging regional resellers and developing joint opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrate Horizon3.ai solutions in virtual and in-person meetings, connecting technical capabilities to customer needs and business outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive the post-proof of value ROI process, helping customers understand business value while building relationships that support satisfaction and retention.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain accurate customer records, pipeline data and forecasts in Salesforce so opportunities, risks and next steps are clearly understood.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work independently to progress opportunities while collaborating with distributed sales, support and customer success teams to deliver a coordinated customer experience.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>What You’ll Bring</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least 5 years of successful cybersecurity sales experience, with a track record of driving growth, introducing disruptive software solutions and consistently exceeding quarterly quotas.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Previous experience selling technical solutions into the UK market.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience establishing and monetising channel partnerships; existing relationships with key regional resellers are essential.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proficiency across the full sales process, including qualification, proof of value, forecasting, negotiation, deal closure and post-proof of value ROI management.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to present and demonstrate cybersecurity solutions effectively, both virtually and in person.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong CRM discipline and experience maintaining accurate pipeline records and forecasts in Salesforce (SFDC).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with Challenger Question-Based Selling-type methodologies and sales tools such as <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://outreach.io/">Outreach</a>, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, ZoomInfo and Slack.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to work independently and collaborate effectively with distributed teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in English; additional language skills are welcomed.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>Travel Required</strong></h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a hybrid company, and this job will require you to spend 3 days based at our Amsterdam city centre sales hub. The role may require up to 40% of travel within the assigned territory to be successful. Job-related travel expenses are reviewed and must be approved by your manager.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Perks of </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Horizon3.ai"><strong>Horizon3.ai</strong></a></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Inclusive Team: We value diversity and promote an inclusive culture where everyone can thrive.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Growth Opportunities: Be part of a dynamic and growing team with numerous career development opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Innovative Culture: Work in a collaborative environment that encourages creativity and out-of-the-box thinking.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Remote Work: We are a 100% remote company. Enjoy the flexibility to work in the way that supports you and brings out your best.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive Compensation: We offer competitive salary, equity and benefits. Our benefits include health, vision &amp; dental insurance for you and your family, a flexible vacation policy, and generous parental leave.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You Belong Here</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Horizon3.ai">Horizon3.ai</a> is not just an equal opportunity employer - we are a community that values diversity, equity, and inclusion as fundamental principles of our culture and success. We are dedicated to fostering a workplace where everyone feels welcome and respected, regardless of race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, marital status, hair length or any other legally protected status by law.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our commitment to diversity and inclusion means we strive to attract, develop, and retain a workforce that reflects the varied communities we serve. We believe that diverse perspectives drive innovation and strengthen our ability to create cutting-edge cybersecurity solutions. At <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Horizon3.ai">Horizon3.ai</a>, every team member is valued and supported in an environment that encourages personal and professional growth.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We welcome candidates from all backgrounds and experiences, and we encourage all qualified individuals to apply. Come be a part of <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Horizon3.ai">Horizon3.ai</a>, where your unique contributions are recognized, and your potential is limitless.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Other Duties</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Please note this job description is not designed to cover or contain a comprehensive listing of activities, duties or responsibilities that are required of the employee. Duties, responsibilities, and activities may change at any time with or without notice.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Application Note</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">In any materials you submit, you may redact or remove age-identifying information such as age, date of birth, or dates of school attendance or graduation. You will not be penalized for redacting or removing this information.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/horizon3ai/commercial-account-executive-uk-amsterdam-188057","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam, Netherlands","created_at":1793342417},{"slug":"data-scientist-marketing-amsterdam-378489","company_name":"bunq","title":"Data Scientist Marketing","description":"<p style="text-align:start;">At bunq, we’re on a mission to Make Life Easy for our users by creating the most user-centric banking experience out there. Our paid marketing campaigns run on predictions about which new users will turn out to be valuable. This role makes sure those predictions are right.</p><p style="text-align:start;">That’s where you come in. As our&nbsp;<strong>Data Scientist, Marketing</strong>, you’ll own the machine learning models that predict the value of every newly verified user and feed that value into Google Ads, so our campaigns find more users like them. If the models are off, the spend is off. AI can help you write and debug code, but it can’t build the model or judge whether the output can be trusted. That judgment is yours.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Take Ownership 🚀</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;">You’ll own the predictive models that steer our marketing spend. Here’s how you’ll do it:</p><ul><li><p>Build, maintain and expand the predictive models for marketing, from first idea to production, starting with the models that predict each new user’s value in their first 90 days.</p></li><li><p>Hit the model quality targets within 9 months: a Spearman rank correlation of 0.50 or higher and a binary model AUC of 0.75 or higher.</p></li><li><p>Keep the models running in production and monitor data and model health to find where to intervene, using Claude Code to move faster and validating everything it produces.</p></li></ul> <br> <ul><li><p>You’ve built predictive models with traditional machine learning, such as XGBoost.</p></li><li><p>You’ve written Python and built the data pipelines a model needs, including when none existed.</p></li><li><p>You’ve shipped ML models to production and kept them running.</p></li><li><p>You’ve done deep dives into data and model health to find what needs intervention.</p></li><li><p>You use AI tools like Claude Code in your daily work and know where they stop.</p></li><li><p>You are fluent in English.</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em>Curious to see how we make life easy? - try the <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://app.adjust.com/1tyd4x67?fallback=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bunq.com%2F&redirect_macos=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bunq.com%2F">bunq app</a>, it only takes 5 minutes to sign up.</em></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>Your space to perform</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;">We give you the space and the tools you need to succeed 💪</p><p style="text-align:start;">🤟 Great, international colleagues who share your mindset</p><p style="text-align:start;">👩‍💻 Hybrid setup: after 3 months in-office, work 2 days remote, 3 days in-office weekly.</p><p style="text-align:start;">🧳 Digital Nomad Program: After your first year, enjoy up to 20 days per year to work while traveling, combining flexibility with strong team collaboration</p><p style="text-align:start;">🚀 We reward tenure with a dedicated travel budget: €1.5k after 2 years and €3k after 4 years to visit another core office.</p><p style="text-align:start;">📚 We support growth with bunq Academy and €1500 annual learning budget</p><p style="text-align:start;">🧘 €60 monthly allowance via Alleo by Epassi, rolling over monthly and resetting annually</p><p style="text-align:start;">🚌﻿ Travel expenses are covered whether you come walking or by bike, bus or car (though we prefer green choices 🌳)</p><p style="text-align:start;">﻿💻 A MacBook so you can Get Shit Done with us</p><p style="text-align:start;">🥦 Delicious lunches from our fabulous in-house chefs with vegan and vegetarian options</p><p style="text-align:start;">💰 An optional pension plan with monthly contribution from bunq</p><p style="text-align:start;">💸 Monthly contribution to your phone and internet bills</p><p style="text-align:start;">🍻 Friday drinks and other celebrations - bunq style﻿</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><em>All new hires are subject to Pre-employment Screening (PES), which includes checks conducted by our third-party partner, Zinc. This is part of our commitment to a secure and trustworthy workplace</em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/bunq/data-scientist-marketing-amsterdam-378489","tags":["Growth"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793341875},{"slug":"stage-of-afstuderen-optimalisatie-van-machine-inspecties-rijssen-150517","company_name":"Voortman Steel Machinery","title":"Stage of Afstuderen: Optimalisatie van Machine-inspecties","description":"<h2>Wat ga je doen?</h2><p>Binnen Customer Service voert Voortman periodieke machine-inspecties uit om de technische staat van machines te beoordelen en klanten te adviseren over onderhoud, reparaties en mogelijke verbeteringen. Deze inspecties vormen een belangrijke basis voor het verhogen van de betrouwbaarheid, prestaties en levensduur van machines.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Het huidige inspectieproces is door de jaren heen organisch gegroeid. Hierdoor worden inspectievragen niet altijd op dezelfde manier geïnterpreteerd, verschillen beoordelingen tussen monteurs en worden bevindingen niet overal uniform vastgelegd. Ook de rapportage richting klanten kan op onderdelen duidelijker, consistenter en meer actiegericht worden ingericht.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Tijdens deze opdracht analyseer je het volledige machine-inspectieproces en ontwikkel je een vernieuwde werkwijze die aansluit bij de huidige en toekomstige behoeften van onze serviceorganisatie. Daarbij kijk je niet alleen naar de inhoud van inspectievragen, maar ook naar de manier waarop inspecteurs informatie verzamelen, beoordelingen uitvoeren, bevindingen vastleggen en resultaten communiceren naar klanten.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je houdt je onder andere bezig met:</p><ul><li><p>Het analyseren van het huidige machine-inspectieproces en het identificeren van verbeterpunten;</p></li><li><p>Het ontwikkelen van een logische en uniforme structuur voor machine-inspecties;</p></li><li><p>Het herformuleren en standaardiseren van bestaande inspectievragen;</p></li><li><p>Het opstellen van duidelijke beoordelingscriteria voor de technische staat van machineonderdelen;</p></li><li><p>Het ontwikkelen van een uniforme methode voor het vastleggen van metingen, bevindingen, foto's en aanbevolen acties;</p></li><li><p>Het verbeteren van inspectierapportages zodat technische bevindingen overzichtelijk, eenduidig en actiegericht worden gepresenteerd;</p></li><li><p>Het opstellen van een implementatievoorstel voor het vernieuwde inspectieproces binnen Customer Service.</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Het eindresultaat is een praktisch en onderbouwd verbeterplan waarmee Voortman machine-inspecties wereldwijd op een uniforme manier kan uitvoeren en klanten nog beter kan ondersteunen met duidelijke inspectierapportages en onderhoudsadviezen.</p> <br> <h2>Wij vragen</h2><ul><li><p><span style="color:#5a5f72">HBO studie in de richting van Technische bedrijfskunde, Werktuigbouwkunde, Mechatronica of vergelijkbaar.</span></p></li></ul><h2>Wij bieden</h2><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Een vergoeding: €600,- per maand;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Reiskostenvergoeding: zodat jij geen onnodige kosten maakt;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Apparatuur en materialen: bijvoorbeeld een laptop, speciaal gereedschap of software;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Ervaren coach: goede begeleiding is belangrijk en dus krijg je een vaste coach om je te ondersteunen;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Ruimte voor persoonlijke ontwikkeling.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><img style="width:1920px" alt="Voortman Nederland" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/58lgk3d2db/Voortman_Nederland-R.jpg"></figure><h2>Over Voortman</h2><p>Wat in 1968 begon in een kippenschuur in Rijssen, is uitgegroeid tot wereldspeler in CNC-staalbewerkingsmachines. Met een team van meer dan 750 collega’s wereldwijd ontwikkelen en bouwen we niet alleen high-end machines, maar ook slimme software en service waarop klanten kunnen vertrouwen. Deze 3 krachtige bouwstenen maken ons Twentse, internationale familiebedrijf uniek.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/voortman-steel-machinery/stage-of-afstuderen-optimalisatie-van-machine-inspecties-rijssen-150517","tags":["Stage & Afstuderen"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Rijssen, Overijssel, Nederland","created_at":1793341875},{"slug":"stage-of-afstuderen-toepassing-van-augmented-reality-rijssen-370233","company_name":"Voortman Steel Machinery","title":"Stage of Afstuderen: Toepassing van Augmented Reality","description":"<h2>Wat ga je doen?</h2><p>Binnen Service &amp; Support onderzoeken we hoe Augmented Reality (AR) kan bijdragen aan een efficiëntere en effectievere dienstverlening. Nieuwe technologieën bieden steeds meer mogelijkheden om klanten en monteurs op afstand te ondersteunen en stilstand van machines te beperken. Wij willen inzicht krijgen in welke toepassingen voor Voortman relevant zijn en hoe deze structureel ingezet kunnen worden binnen onze serviceorganisatie.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Tijdens deze stage onderzoek je de technische en organisatorische mogelijkheden van Augmented Reality binnen service en remote support. Je analyseert verschillende toepassingsmogelijkheden, waaronder het gebruik van een RealWear Smart Glass voor ondersteuning op afstand. Daarnaast onderzoek je welke procesveranderingen nodig zijn om AR succesvol te implementeren en welke voordelen dit kan opleveren voor de kwaliteit, snelheid en efficiëntie van onze serviceprocessen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je werkzaamheden bestaan onder andere uit:</p><ul><li><p>Het onderzoeken van de mogelijkheden van Augmented Reality binnen customer service, remote support en field service;</p></li><li><p>Het analyseren van de inzet van de RealWear Smart Glass voor het ondersteunen van monteurs en klanten op afstand;</p></li><li><p>Het in kaart brengen van benodigde procesveranderingen voor de implementatie van Smart Glasses;</p></li><li><p>Het bepalen van mogelijke procesverbeteringen op het gebied van efficiëntie, reactietijd en servicekwaliteit.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Het eindresultaat van de opdracht is een onderbouwd implementatieplan waarmee Voortman de inzet van Augmented Reality binnen haar serviceorganisatie kan beoordelen en verder ontwikkelen.</p> <br> <h2>Wij vragen</h2><ul><li><p>Een HBO- of WO-opleiding in de richting van Bedrijfskunde, Technische Bedrijfskunde, Applicatie Technologie of vergelijkbaar.</p></li></ul><h2>Wij bieden</h2><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Een vergoeding: €600,- per maand;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Reiskostenvergoeding: zodat jij geen onnodige kosten maakt;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Apparatuur en materialen: bijvoorbeeld een laptop, speciaal gereedschap of software;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Ervaren coach: goede begeleiding is belangrijk en dus krijg je een vaste coach om je te ondersteunen;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Ruimte voor persoonlijke ontwikkeling.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><img style="width:1920px" alt="Voortman Nederland" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/58lgk3d2db/Voortman_Nederland-R.jpg"></figure><h2>Over Voortman</h2><p>Wat in 1968 begon in een kippenschuur in Rijssen, is uitgegroeid tot wereldspeler in CNC-staalbewerkingsmachines. Met een team van meer dan 750 collega’s wereldwijd ontwikkelen en bouwen we niet alleen high-end machines, maar ook slimme software en service waarop klanten kunnen vertrouwen. Deze 3 krachtige bouwstenen maken ons Twentse, internationale familiebedrijf uniek.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/voortman-steel-machinery/stage-of-afstuderen-toepassing-van-augmented-reality-rijssen-370233","tags":["Stage & Afstuderen"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Rijssen, Overijssel, Nederland","created_at":1793341875},{"slug":"strategic-account-executive-medtech-amsterdam-159711","company_name":"databricks","title":"Strategic Account Executive, Medtech","description":"&lt;p&gt;SLSQ128R106&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to help solve the world&#39;s toughest problems with big data and AI? This is what we do every day at Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a creative, execution-oriented Strategic Account Executive to join the Benelux team to maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks within the Medtech industry. Your mission will be to grow one of our most strategic customers in partnership with our Global Account Manager. Experience selling to this sector is essential, as is experience in running large complex multi-national accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director of Healthcare and Life Science in the Benelux, as a Strategic Account Executive at Databricks you will come with an informed and compelling point of view on the Data, Analytics and AI space which will guide your successful strategy and together with both our teams and partners, allow you to provide exceptional value to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will co-develop a business plan, with your team and ecosystem partners, that accelerates customer success to exceed quarterly/annual usage and booking goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will lead your team, customers and partners to identify impactful data and AI use cases whilst proving out their value on the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will implement the&amp;nbsp; data and AI transformation goals of your customer through a combination of strategic partnerships, well-scoped professional services, training and targeted Executive Engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop an understanding of technical product details and roadmap to build trust with executives and technical champions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience developing strong relationships with large global enterprises, managing virtual teams, and leading complex sales campaigns in major Medtech or manufacturing accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience working in Data, Cloud, or SaaS industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proof of exceeding sales quotas in high-growth Enterprise software companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience driving usage and commit-based engagement models and strategies working with professional services and training teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience co-selling and scaling your business with Cloud Vendors (AWS, Azure and Google Cloud teams) and Global Solution Integrators (GSI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience co-developing business cases and gaining support from C-level Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience of value-based selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/databricks/strategic-account-executive-medtech-amsterdam-159711","tags":["Enterprise Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1793321723},{"slug":"forward-deployed-engineer-amsterdam-144415","company_name":"databricks","title":"Forward Deployed Engineer","description":"&lt;p&gt;CSQ327R45&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) you will work with customers to build and productionize solutions to their data &amp;amp; AI challenges using the Databricks platform. You will own the architecture, lead design decisions, and implement end-to-end systems spanning data engineering, AI, and application development. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations. FDEs deliver with customer empathy, integrating with client systems, training, and other technical needs to help customers get most value out of their data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, customer-facing role for builders who thrive at the intersection of technology and business impact. The ideal candidate combines engineering expertise with adaptability, curiosity, and a passion for working with customers and teammates to solve complex problems that drive measurable outcomes. FDEs are billable and know how to complete projects according to specification with exceptional customer empathy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Solution Delivery: Lead impactful customer technical projects by delivering production-grade systems, designing and building reference architectures, custom applications and data ingestion and ML/AI model integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformational Impact: Guide strategic customers as they implement transformational big data projects including end-to-end design, build and deployment of industry-leading big data and AI applications. Work with engagement managers to scope technical delivery work with input from the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Customers: Guide customers on architecture and design; bootstrap or implement customer projects which leads to a customers&#39; successful understanding, evaluation and adoption of Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Architecture: Lead architecture and design decisions, ensuring solutions are secure, scalable, and aligned with both customer needs and Databricks best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Databricks technical team, Project Manager, Architect and Customer team to ensure the technical components of the engagement are delivered to meet customer&#39;s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Engineering and Databricks Customer Support to provide product and implementation feedback and to guide rapid resolution for engagement specific product and support issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Immersion: Embed with customer teams, engaging with stakeholders from technical ICs to executives to deeply understand challenges and deliver impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reusable Assets &amp;amp; Scale: Contribute accelerators, frameworks, and best practices that scale impact across accounts and influence the Databricks product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in data engineering, data platforms &amp;amp; analytics, or software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable writing code in either Python, Scala, JavaScript/TypeScript, and modern frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of two or more common Cloud ecosystems (AWS, Azure, GCP) with expertise in at least one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with distributed computing with Apache Spark™ and knowledge of Spark runtime internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD for production deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MLOps, ML/AI models and AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deployment of performant production end-to-end data architectures and applications that combine data pipelines, ML/AI models, and user-facing interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical project delivery - managing scope, timelines and measurable outcomes, translating complex concepts into actionable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and white-boarding skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise clients and managing conflicts across a broad stakeholder range&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build skills in technical areas, and demonstrate curiosity, adaptability, and eagerness to explore new technologies which support the deployment and integration of Databricks-based solutions to complete customer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customers 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/databricks/forward-deployed-engineer-amsterdam-144415","tags":["Professional Services Operations"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1793321723},{"slug":"engineering-manager-product-catalogs-111267","company_name":"reddit","title":"Engineering Manager, Product Catalogs","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Reddit is a community of communities. It’s built on shared interests, passion, and trust, and is home to the most open and authentic conversations on the internet. Every day, Reddit users submit, vote, and comment on the topics they care most about. With 100,000+ active communities and approximately 130 million daily active unique visitors, Reddit is one of the internet’s largest sources of information. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.redditinc.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://redditinc.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.redditinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is open to candidates based in the UK or the Netherlands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ads team is developing Dynamic Product Ads, enabling us to match users to specific advertiser products. Our vision is for Reddit’s product ads to be highly relevant and contextual. A user browsing r/golf sees ads for popular golf clubs. A user reading a thread on r/buyitforlife about sunglasses sees ads for the exact models being discussed, just a few clicks away from a purchase. To achieve this vision, we need a highly scalable catalog infrastructure and intuitive user experience to onboard thousands of advertisers and ingest millions of products into our systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager for the Product Catalogs team at Reddit, you will lead the full stack team responsible for our entire advertiser-facing experience. You will build UIs, APIs, and backend systems that manage advertiser’s products. The team also works closely with the knowledge graph teams to power organic shopping. This role combines technical expertise, leadership abilities, and drive to understand and deliver on customer needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a world class catalogs system that can scale to support billions of products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers and designers to craft compelling user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a wide range of teams from Ad Formats to Ad Delivery to ensure successful end-to-end delivery of product ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and manage to SLAs within your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a strong mentor and cross-functional advocate for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute meaningfully to team strategy. We give everyone a seat at the table and encourage active participation in planning for the future. Don’t just come along for the ride.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in backend or full stack product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience managing engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re highly technical, enough to solve almost any problem your team has yourself, but you prefer to guide your team into solving them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently. You’ll be working with stakeholders that are mostly based in North America. You need to be able to make decisions and solve problems autonomously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills. You must be able to collaborate effectively with teams in a fully-remote environment and discuss complex topics with technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3156&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Global Benefit programs that fit your lifestyle, from workspace to professional development to caregiving support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3273&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Family Planning Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3301&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Gender-Affirming Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3326&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Mental Health &amp;amp; Coaching Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3363&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Private Pension plan with Employer-matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3410&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;100% employer-sponsored group medical plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3458&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Income Replacement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3489&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Flexible Vacation &amp;amp; Paid Volunteer Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3536&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8c5ff10a-7296-4539-815b-c31a42a4d2d0&quot;&gt;Generous Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In select roles and locations, the interviews will be recorded, transcribed and summarized by artificial intelligence (AI). You will have the opportunity to opt out of recording, transcription and summarization prior to any scheduled interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;During the interview, we will collect the following categories of personal information: Identifiers, Professional and Employment-Related Information, Sensory Information (audio/video recording), and any other categories of personal information you choose to share with us. We will use this information to evaluate your application for employment or an independent contractor role, as applicable.&amp;nbsp; We will not sell your personal information or disclose it to any third party for their marketing purposes.&amp;nbsp; We will delete any recording of your interview promptly after making a hiring decision.&amp;nbsp; For more information about how we will handle your personal information, including our retention of it, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://redditinc.com/policies/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy for Potential Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reddit is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, and is committed to building a workforce representative of the diverse communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; Reddit is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If, due to a disability, you need an accommodation during the interview process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/reddit/engineering-manager-product-catalogs-111267","tags":["Ads Product & Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1793321721},{"slug":"senior-it-engineer-391043","company_name":"typeform","title":"Senior IT Engineer","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Typeform, we believe technology should make work simpler, smarter and more human.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior IT Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to help shape the future of IT at Typeform. Someone who combines strong technical expertise with a passion for automation, AI and building better ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t just about keeping systems running. It&#39;s about rethinking how IT operates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll play a key role in building an AI first, service led IT function, improving how we manage internal technology, support our people and automate everyday processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working within a small, high impact team, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to take ownership of meaningful projects, influence our technology roadmap and help us move from reactive support towards smarter, more proactive IT operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and improve our IT operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for complex IT incidents, requests and technical challenges, taking ownership through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain secure, reliable and scalable internal technology systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply ITIL best practices across incident, change, problem and service management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve service performance, documentation, operational processes and the overall employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the wider IT team to balance daily support with longer term engineering projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build smarter systems through AI and automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate repetitive tasks and improve workflows across IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement AI powered solutions that improve service delivery, productivity and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve employee onboarding, offboarding, access management and software lifecycle processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use APIs, integrations, scripting and automation tools to connect systems and remove unnecessary manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore emerging AI technologies and turn promising ideas into practical solutions, with appropriate security and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think like a product owner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of specific IT services and capabilities, from identifying problems through to delivering improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with stakeholders to understand their needs and prioritise improvements based on business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain clear roadmaps and project backlogs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the success of improvements through service quality, efficiency, reliability and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical changes, migrations and improvements with clear communication, risk management and planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across Typeform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, People, Finance, Procurement and Engineering to deliver secure and effective technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical concepts clearly to both technical and nontechnical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge, improve documentation and support the development of other IT team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help create a culture of ownership, continuous improvement and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in corporate IT engineering, systems engineering or IT service management within a modern SaaS or technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITIL certification and practical experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;applying ITIL principles across incident, change, problem and service management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience troubleshooting complex issues across corporate IT systems, identity, access, devices, applications and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands on experience with modern IT environments, particularly Apple devices, Okta, Google Workspace, Slack and Atlassian.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building automation using APIs, scripting, integrations or workflow automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI to improve IT operations, support processes or internal productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving employee lifecycle processes, including onboarding, offboarding, provisioning and access management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem solving skills and the ability to take ownership of technical challenges from investigation through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product mindset, with experience prioritising improvements, managing stakeholders and delivering measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to work effectively across technical and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing AI driven IT workflows or introducing AI into internal service operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI agents, intelligent workflow orchestration and knowledge management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating HR, identity, finance, asset management and IT service platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal tooling, dashboards or operational reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to security, compliance, endpoint management and IT governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading technology migrations or large internal systems improvement projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/typeform/senior-it-engineer-391043","tags":["People and Culture"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1793321718},{"slug":"service-desk-technician-amsterdam-470017","company_name":"Mollie","title":"Service Desk Technician","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build with us</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Since 2004, we've had one clear goal: to make payments and money management effortless for every business in Europe.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Today, more than 250,000 companies use Mollie to get paid, manage money and grow – with products designed to be simple, scalable, and dependable.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">With 950+ Mollies across 14+ locations, we care deeply about autonomy and craft. So we work in small teams, with real ownership, and we trust you to make the right decisions.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're building for the long term, so we provide the tools you need, processes you can rely on, and a balanced work environment to help you do work you're proud of.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sound like your kind of place? Let's build together.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your impact</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be the heartbeat of our internal operations. Mollie is one of the fastest-growing companies in Europe, welcoming around 15 new colleagues every month. As Service Desk Technician, you are the first point of contact for all IT-related questions and the face of IT for our Amsterdam office. Your work makes sure 1000+ Mollies can build the future of payments without technical friction.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You help new colleagues get started and you handle incidents, problems and requests, with a focus on Apple. You keep teams from Engineering to Sales connected, productive and secure.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">With a customer-obsessed mindset, you will give hands-on support at the office and remote assistance across Europe. When a tech headache shows up, you turn it into a seamless experience.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll ship</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Troubleshoot, resolve and document IT issues across networking, hardware, software and related services</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support 1000+ colleagues, mostly on Apple devices</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as the first line of support and escalate to the wider team when needed</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Facilitate employee onboarding and help new colleagues get up and running</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to projects and ongoing service improvements</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll bring</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">2 to 4 years of service desk experience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A customer-first mindset</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong troubleshooting skills, including on systems you haven't seen before</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience administering Google Workspace and Slack</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with Jira or a similar service management tool</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to work independently, stay organised and prioritise a busy workload</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to work well with a wide range of teams and colleagues</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Grow your way</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Mollie, growth is personal. We believe everyone should have the chance to develop their skills, explore new challenges and shape their career on their own terms.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll get regular feedback and performance reviews to support your development, with fair and transparent salary reviews along the way. Many Mollies move into new roles or take on new projects to stretch themselves, and we actively hire from within to help you take the next step.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">No matter if you're aiming for promotion, exploring a different career path or building new skills, you'll be supported with the tools, trust and opportunities to grow your way.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Unlock your full potential and join us to eliminate financial bureaucracy</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you're excited by the idea of building what's next, for yourself and for thousands of businesses across Europe, we'd love to hear from you. Apply with your CV (in English) using the form below.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI at Mollie</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe in Always Be Shipping, and AI brings that philosophy to life across every team, every role, every day.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI is core to how we build. It helps us move faster, simplify work and make smarter decisions, creating real impact for the businesses we serve. We're looking for people who are excited to use AI to shape the future of finance with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/mollie/service-desk-technician-amsterdam-470017","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1793320816},{"slug":"tech-talent-acquisition-business-partner-1-year-fixed-term-contract-amsterdam-225417","company_name":"Mollie","title":"Tech Talent Acquisition Business Partner (1 Year Fixed-Term Contract)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build with us</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Since 2004, we've had one clear goal: to make payments and money management effortless for every business in Europe.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Today, more than 250,000 companies use Mollie to get paid, manage money and grow – with products designed to be simple, scalable, and dependable.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">With 950+ Mollies across 14+ locations, we care deeply about autonomy and craft. So we work in small teams, with real ownership, and we trust you to make the right decisions.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're building for the long term, so we provide the tools you need, processes you can rely on, and a balanced work environment to help you do work you're proud of.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sound like your kind of place? Let's build together.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>Your impact</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As our Talent Acquisition Business Partner, you'll own end-to-end hiring across our most important tech roles, from Application Engineering to Platform and beyond. You're the person making sure we hire the right people, fast. No hand-holding. No waiting. You see what needs to happen and you make it happen.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This isn't a generalist role, but it does require range. You're an experienced tech recruiter who's comfortable across different areas of the tech landscape, and can easily context switch. You'll partner directly with Engineering stakeholders to shape hiring strategy, sharpen briefs, and raise the bar on every search. You'll bring structure where it's missing, challenge assumptions that slow things down, and take ownership of projects that currently sit with leadership. You're the kind of person who spots a blocker on Monday and has it resolved by Tuesday.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Tech hiring is what will make or break our growth, and you'll be the person who builds the foundation that makes it possible. Real ownership, real visibility, and a direct line to shaping Mollie's future.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>What you'll ship</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own end-to-end hiring for Engineering roles - from intake to offer - with the pace and precision our teams depend on</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build real partnerships with Engineering stakeholders, shaping how they approach hiring, not just executing on their requests</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring structure and craft to tech intake, calibration, and pipeline planning, so every hiring decision reflects both immediate needs and where the team is headed</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Spot the process, execution, or alignment gaps that are slowing down tech hiring, and fix them before they become someone else's problem</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take ownership of bigger tech hiring projects that currently sit with leadership, freeing them up and raising TA's impact across the business</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plug into and build on Mollie's AI-enabled recruiting practice - contributing to the automation, AI tools, and data-driven workflows we're building across sourcing, workflows, decision-making, and candidate experience to continuously raise the bar on hiring quality</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring sharp market intelligence - tech talent trends, compensation benchmarks, candidate behaviour - to inform better decisions and improve quality of hire</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>What you'll bring</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5+ years of recruiting experience with a strong focus on tech hiring, ideally in high-growth or scale-up environments</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A natural ability to engage, influence, and challenge Engineering stakeholders - you're a true business partner, not an order taker</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience owning complex tech searches end-to-end, from high-volume evergreen roles to senior or niche engineering positions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong sense of ownership: you pick things up independently, drive them to completion, and resolve blockers without waiting to be told</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort using recruiting data, pipeline analysis, and market insights to guide decisions - and the confidence to act on what you find</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of bringing structure and improving execution in ambiguous, fast-moving environments where the playbook doesn't always exist yet</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>Grow your way</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Mollie, growth is personal. We believe everyone should have the chance to develop their skills, explore new challenges and shape their career on their own terms.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll get regular feedback and performance reviews to support your development, with fair and transparent salary reviews along the way. Many Mollies move into new roles or take on new projects to stretch themselves, and we actively hire from within to help you take the next step.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">No matter if you're aiming for promotion, exploring a different career path or building new skills, you'll be supported with the tools, trust and opportunities to grow your way.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>Unlock your full potential and join us to eliminate financial bureaucracy</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you're excited by the idea of building what's next, for yourself and for thousands of businesses across Europe, we'd love to hear from you. Apply with your CV (in English) using the form below.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Want a peek behind the scenes? Check out what life at Mollie is really like.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>AI at Mollie</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe in Always Be Shipping, and AI brings that philosophy to life across every team, every role, every day.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI is core to how we build. It helps us move faster, simplify work and make smarter decisions, creating real impact for the businesses we serve. We're looking for people who are excited to use AI to shape the future of finance with us.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/mollie/tech-talent-acquisition-business-partner-1-year-fixed-term-contract-amsterdam-225417","tags":["People"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1793320816},{"slug":"senior-backend-engineer-amsterdam-465520","company_name":"Tebi","title":"Senior Backend Engineer","description":"<h2><strong>About Us</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Tebi is creating the first Connected Restaurant Management System that makes hospitality flow. In one seamless platform, Tebi embeds sales, reservations, kitchen prep, payments, and all the data that powers it, creating smooth service and intuitive insights.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founded by Arnout Schuijff, co-founder of Adyen, and backed by €50 million in funding from Index Ventures &amp; CapitalG, Tebi is built in service of hospitality first. Thousands of restaurants, cafés, bars, and coffee shops across the Netherlands, UK, Italy, Spain, Germany, Denmark and Finland already love running on Tebi.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>About the role:</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for a Senior Backend Engineer to help us build powerful, delightful features that empower restaurant teams. You’ll work across the stack to bring new ideas to life, whether it’s building intuitive interfaces, scalable backend services, or the glue in between that makes everything feel seamless.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll collaborate closely with design, product, and other engineers to rapidly ship impactful features. As an early team member, you’ll also help shape our engineering culture, tooling, and technical direction.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is perfect for someone who thrives in fast-paced environments, loves solving real user problems, and wants to help modernize an underserved industry with thoughtful, elegant software.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Responsibilities:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build, test, and ship end-to-end features across the stack—from APIs and data models.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with designers and PMs to translate user needs into working, intuitive product experiences</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own projects from concept to launch and beyond, balancing speed, quality, and scalability</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Improve system performance and reliability across frontend and backend systems</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help evolve our codebase and technical architecture as we scale</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to shared tooling, component libraries, and best practices that level up the whole team</p></li></ul><h2><strong>What you’ll need:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">8+ years of professional experience as a fullstack or backend engineer in a product-focused environment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep expertise in either Kotlin, Java, or Scala.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Significant experience with distributed systems. You know how to build and maintain scalable, resilient services that work together.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with event-driven architectures (e.g., Kafka).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Good experience of relational databases, such as Postgres.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable working with APIs, relational databases, and docker</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A product mindset, you care about the why behind what you’re building and optimizing for user impact</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to work collaboratively across functions and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong attention to detail and a sense of pride in crafting great user experiences</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What is Restaurant Software?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Restaurants and other merchants use various software systems such as Point of Sale (POS), Reservations, Kitchen Display Systems (KDS), Payments, Inventory, Staffing, and the list goes on. These systems all need to speak to each other which they frequently don’t. It’s a mess, and we are fixing it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">From buying a croissant at a cafe to having dinner with friends, it’s a €4 Trillion+ global market and a critical part of everyday life in today's economy.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How we use AI at Tebi</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We use AI the way our merchants use Tebi, to cut out the friction and get to what matters faster. We believe in a world where AI increases quality, efficiency and speed.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Tebi, AI isn't a policy or a checkbox, it's just part of how we work. It helps us write, analyse, build, and improve but doesn’t make the last call. If there's a smarter way to do something, we want to find it.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/tebi/senior-backend-engineer-amsterdam-465520","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1793320815},{"slug":"iam-software-engineer-waardenburg-gelderland-358802","company_name":"Sitsgroup","title":"IAM Software Engineer","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;sc-1fwbcuw-0 kmPvct&quot;&gt;
