anking company" src="https://angeheuertjobs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Konzentrierter-Entwickler-im-Datenbuero-1024x576.png"></figure><h3 class="wp-block-heading" style="text-align:start;"><strong>Your benefits as Data Engineer</strong></h3><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><p><strong>Compensation:</strong> Enjoy an attractive salary with an additional variable component that reflects your experience and technical expertise.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Creative Freedom:</strong> Help build a central data platform from the ground up and bring your own technical ideas to the table. You will have plenty of room to explore modern solutions and actively shape the technical architecture.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexibility:</strong> Organize your working day largely on your own and work flexibly from home or anywhere in Germany. At the same time, you should be willing to attend important meetings, workshops, and in person collaboration when required.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Workation:</strong> Take up to four weeks of workation within the EU and, subject to agreement, potentially beyond the EU.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Pension:</strong> Benefit from an occupational pension scheme with a 50% employer contribution.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Development:</strong> Take advantage of individual training opportunities, language courses, and personal learning programs.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>International Environment:</strong> Work in an international environment where both German and English are used as business languages.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><h3 class="wp-block-heading" style="text-align:start;"><strong>Your tasks as Data Engineer</strong></h3><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><p><strong>Data Layer:</strong> Take ownership of operating and further developing the Databricks based data platform, including workspaces, jobs, and permissions.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Data Pipelines:</strong> Develop robust ETL and ELT pipelines for banking, treasury, payments, export finance, and other data sources.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Architecture:</strong> Design Data Lake and Lakehouse structures as well as scalable and high performance data models.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Data Quality:</strong> Implement automated quality checks and ensure data completeness, timeliness, and consistency.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Monitoring:</strong> Build monitoring and alerting for pipelines, jobs, latency, and errors.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Governance:</strong> Document data flows and lineage and support data classification, access controls, and regulatory requirements.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>AI Enablement:</strong> Provide suitable data and interfaces for AI use cases and MLOps.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaboration:</strong> Support business teams with data analysis and work closely with Architecture, Platform, Risk, and Compliance.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><h3 class="wp-block-heading" style="text-align:start;"><strong>Your profile</strong></h3><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><p><strong>Education:</strong> A degree in Computer Science, Data Engineering, Business Informatics, or a comparable qualification provides the foundation for this role.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Experience:</strong> Several years of experience in Data Engineering and building productive data platforms.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Technology:</strong> Very good knowledge of Databricks, SQL, and modern ETL and ELT patterns.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Architecture:</strong> Experience with Data Lake or Lakehouse architectures, data modelling, and data quality.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Cloud:</strong> Experience with Infrastructure as Code in cloud environments is important, ideally complemented by Azure or AWS knowledge.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Operations:</strong> Experience with monitoring, error handling, and operationalizing productive data pipelines.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Communication:</strong> Strong communication skills and very good English at C1 level.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p><strong>Additional Skills:</strong> Experience with banking, finance, Power BI, DORA, SFTP, or AI and ML data pipelines is an advantage.</p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;">Do you have your own ideas about how a modern data platform should be built and want the freedom to put them into practice? <strong>Then this role offers the technical freedom you rarely find within established structures.</strong>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/angeheuert-gmbh/remote-data-engineer-frankfurt-am-main-159193","tags":["Remote"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Homeoffice","created_at":1793374277},{"slug":"remote-lead-architect-platform-engineer-frankfurt-am-main-102119","company_name":"ANGEHEUERT GmbH","title":"Lead Architect & Platform Engineer (m/f/d)","description":"<h1 class="job-detail-title" style="text-align:start;"><strong>Lead Architect &amp; Platform Engineer</strong></h1><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;">Are you looking for an architecture role where you do not simply optimize existing structures within a decades old IT environment? As a <strong>Lead Architect &amp; Platform Engineer</strong>, you will have the opportunity to build key parts of a modern cloud and platform architecture from the ground up while actively shaping standards, integration patterns, and technical guidelines. <strong>Apply now and help build the technological foundation for the company’s next stage of development.</strong>&nbsp;</p><figure class="alignleft size-large is-resized"><img style="width:665px" alt="Lead Architect & Platform Engineer searched in finance and banking" src="https://angeheuertjobs.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Kollegiales-Gesprae