 experience.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>About the role:</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Client Impact at Upvest owns our clients' journey from signature to go-live and beyond, spanning Launch, Migrations, Account Management, Client Experience and Integration Success. Once a client is live, Account Management takes over: we own the relationship end to end, grow it commercially, run it strategically and make sure our clients see Upvest as a partner, not a vendor. Client satisfaction is one of the things that sets us apart from incumbents, and recommendations from our live clients have already been key to new wins.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for a Head of Account Management to lead this team and Upvest's live client portfolio, which includes some of Europe's best-known fintechs, neobrokers and banks. You will own the commercial development of the portfolio (renewals, upsell, ARR and revenue retention) and the senior relationships behind it, lead a team of senior Account Managers, and build the operating model that lets us scale. This is a hands-on leadership role: you will sit across the table from client C-levels yourself, not only manage the people who do.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will report directly to Jens Maluck, VP Client Impact, and work closely with Growth, Product, Launch, Client Experience and Finance.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What you’ll do:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Commercial growth</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the commercial development of the live client portfolio: renewals, expansions and upsells, against budget and upsell targets</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Spot commercial opportunities and leveraging knowledge across the portfolio</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead commercial negotiations for live clients, including 