, or another B2B technology environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>ERP and finance technology ecosystem</strong>: Hands on experience working with ERP, accounting and finance automation vendors and their partner ecosystems (e.g Netsuite, Microsoft Dynamics, Sage, Xero, Datev).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Commercial performance:</strong> A history of building partnerships that generate measurable sales pipeline and revenue against targets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Builder mentality:</strong> Comfortable developing new partner relationships and go-to-market motions from scratch rather than simply managing an established programme.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Executive presence:</strong> Strong communication and presentation skills, with the credibility to build relationships and negotiate with senior and C-level stakeholders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Commercial judgment:</strong> Able to assess which opportunities are worth pursuing, structure mutually valuable partnerships, and focus time on the relationships most likely to produce meaningful results.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Cross-functional mindset:</strong> A low-ego, team-first approach and the ability to work effectively across Sales, Marketing, Customer Success, Product, and other teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ownership:</strong> Independent, ambitious, persistent, and comfortable being accountable for outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Based within commuting distance of our hub.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Travel:</strong> Willingness to travel regularly across Europe for partner meetings, conferences and events.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What we offer</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Receive competitive compensation and equity ownership in Perk</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Rest and recharge with 25 days of annual leave plus bank holidays</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take control of your physical health with private medical cover and voluntary dental insurance from Bupa, and discounted gym memberships with GymFlex</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan for your future with our qualifying earnings company pension plan with Aviva</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Know that your loved ones are protected financially through your Life Insurance if the worst were to happen</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Rest assured that you’re covered by income protection in case you experience a long-term sickness or absence</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Leverage tax-efficient cycle and electric car schemes with Cycle2Work &amp; Octopus</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join our unforgettable Perk events, including our spectacular annual summer party</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Always feel supported with Spring Health, our market-leading wellbeing partner, providing fast, comprehensive access to 12x therapy and 12x coaching sessions for you and your loved ones</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Focus on your family with 12-16 weeks’ paid parental leave</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to your community with 16 paid hours per year to spend volunteering for your dearest charitable causes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Broaden your horizons with up to 20 "Work from Anywhere" days per year</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stay savvy with access to a wide variety of discounts and rewards</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Follow your passions and take a four-week, fully paid sabbatical once you reach 5 years</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Let us help you move to one of our hubs with relocation support</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Interview Process</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-