<li>Craft user research plans and work directly with our user researchers to identify problems and validate solutions in user testing.</li>
<li>Contribute to Wave's design system and component library.</li>
<li>Talk to customers and find solutions to their problems by thinking critically from their perspective.</li>
<li>Communicate the reasoning behind your product decisions in review sessions and in conversation with PMs.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Prototype visual and UX concepts and iterate towards the right solution (Wave uses Claude for mobile prototyping with Android apks).</li>
</ul>
<h2><strong>Key details</strong></h2>
<ul>
<li>This is a fully remote role. Candidates must be based in one of our hiring hubs (US, UK, Spain, Kenya, Ghana, Canada) or in one of our operating markets in Africa, including Senegal, Côte d'Ivoire, and Burkina Faso.</li>
<li>You'll travel to one of our key markets for a 1 week immersion trip with your immediate team (Wave covers all costs). Outside of this 1 week immersion, you'll also travel to a market country with our product design lead and PMs, for a total of travel 2x a year. You're highly encouraged to visit market counties more often! We also provide a yearly stipend of $1,200 USD to meet with coworkers every year.</li>
<li>Our salaries are competitive and are calculated using a transparent formula. For this role, we are offering a salary of up to $187,000 USD based on your location (paid in your local currency equivalent), plus a generous equity package.</li>
<li>Major benefits:
<ul>
