s who hire through it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll own our paid channels day to day. You'll decide where the money goes, launch and test campaigns quickly, and judge every channel on the quality of the people it brings in, not on clicks or cheap signups. Creative comes from our in-house creative lead, writers and UGC creators; your job is to brief them well, test what they make and scale what works.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This isn't a role where you sit in the ad accounts all week. Once the channels are running well, we want you to take on more: client-side acquisition, new channels, and building your own tools with AI to do the job faster.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What you'll do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own Google Search, LinkedIn and Meta: structure, budgets, bidding, audiences and day-to-day optimisation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Launch new campaigns in days, not weeks. Run a steady programme of tests across audiences, formats and landing pages.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Judge channels on what matters to Dex: good candidates and the ones who get put forward to clients. Work with our data to make sure conversion tracking and attribution are right, and push quality signals back into the platforms.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Brief creative. Work with our creative lead, writers and UGC creators on what to make, tell them what's working and kill what isn't.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Open up new channels as we grow, such as YouTube, Performance Max, retargeting and new markets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help take paid into client acquisition: getting Dex in front of heads of talent, engineering leaders and founders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage our paid media agency and any contractors, and bring more of the work in-house over time.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Report clearly on spend and results each week, and say plainly what you'd change.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Who we're looking for</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands on in performance marketing, managing real budgets yourself across paid search and paid social. Meta and LinkedIn experience matters most.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've worked at a tech company, or you're ready for your first in-house role after a couple of years at a strong agency.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You care about what happens after the click. You've optimised for downstream quality, not just cost per lead, and you know how to set up tracking that you trust.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable with data. You can pull your own numbers, spot when something looks wrong, and explain what's going on without a dashboard doing it for you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You move fast and like owning things. You'd rather ship a test today than plan it for a week.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You use AI tools daily, and you're happy building small tools, scripts or agents to do your job better. You don't need to be an engineer.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Strong nice-to-haves</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've run performance marketing for both consumer (B2C) and business (B2B) audiences, ideally at more than one tech company.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've worked closely with a creative studio or run UGC at volume, so you know what a good brief looks like.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you don't tick every box but this sounds like you, apply anyway.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Why join now</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll own a channel mix that's growing fast, with the budget and freedom to try things.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll work on a product people care about. Changing jobs is one of the biggest decisions engineers make, and we want them to trust us with it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll work closely with the founders and the Head of Growth, with a lot of room to grow your scope.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Everyone here builds with AI. You'll have the tools and the time to work that way.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What we offer</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Above-market salary</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Significant equity</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Private healthcare and dental</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fertility benefits and enhanced parental support</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Gym membership and wellness benefits</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Claude tokens</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Regular socials, offsites and an annual team trip</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">MacBook Pro and team equipment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A "whatever you need" approach to tools and support</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>The process</strong></h2><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Talent screen with Becca, Head of Talent (30 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hiring manager interview with Rob, Head of Growth (45 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Practical task: a short paid acquisition audit and plan, done at home</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">In person: task review with Rob and the growth team (60 min), culture and values (45 min), final interview with Paddy, CEO and founder (30 min)</p></li></ol><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/