"min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define and implement the strategies, plans, policies, governance structures and procedures to manage the treasury risks facing the group.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure compliance with group treasury policy and own the group treasury policy to ensure it is updated and refreshed as and when necessary.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Effectively manage bank and rating agency relationships, and play a key role in refinancing activities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assessment and management of all business-related financial risks including FX, interest rate and counterparty risk management.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure efficient management of cash and liquidity through robust short-term and long-term cash flow forecasting.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Development of treasury systems environment and robust controls framework.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Development of cash pooling and cash management arrangements.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with the business to oversee and help improve working capital performance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Consider future plans for further expansion of the function as the business scales.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">🧠 <strong>What you’ll bring to the party:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be a treasury professional with experience in an international treasury environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong commercial awareness and business focus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven technical skills in all areas of treasury management.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong communication skills at all levels.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to work in a “start up” environment, experience developing policies, processes, and strategy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">E