plore new possibilities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Find the gap:</strong> We are curious and we proactively approach identifying opportunities and solving problems before they arise.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Collective accountability:</strong> We are one team, on one mission and we are committed to shared responsibilities and mutual support, enabling trust and collaboration.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Value add solutions: </strong>Know better. Act better. We are dedicated to delivering meaningful and impactful results.</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/rivia/senior-ai-engineer-zurich-162742","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Zurich","created_at":1793277640},{"slug":"procurement-supply-chain-lead-zurich-447215","company_name":"Hyperscale Power","title":"Procurement & Supply Chain Lead","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Hyperscale Power</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hyperscale Power is building the power backbone for the AI data center era: a complete power conversion chain from 13.8kV–35kV medium-voltage AC down to 800V DC, combining ultra-compact SiC-based AC/DC and DC/DC power blocks. As we scale from Alpha customer readiness toward Production and Volume Readiness, securing the right components at the right price and lead time – power semiconductors, magnetics, PCBs and mechanical parts – becomes mission-critical.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The role</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As Procurement &amp; Supply Chain Lead, you will own the purchasing and supply chain for the materials, equipment, parts and services that keep our prototype, pilot and volume production on track – from negotiating with suppliers to coordinating with contract manufacturers and logistics partners. You will partner closely 