nology teams and communicate the answers clearly to customers and the Commercial team.</p></li></ul><p><strong>What you bring</strong></p><ul><li><p>An excellent degree, for example in business, economics, data science, engineering or industrial engineering. We are looking for excellence, curiosity, creativity and courage - not to have studied a perfect subject.</p></li><li><p>Some practical experience through an internship, part-time job, personal project or entrepreneurial initiative.</p></li><li><p>An analytical mindset, confidence with Excel and the ability to understand and communicate complex ideas and interdependencies clearly and simply.</p></li><li><p>Ability to think outside of the box and to question conventional ways of doing things. </p></li><li><p>Experience with AI tools such as ChatGPT, Claude or Copilot - and the excellent judgement to critically assess their output. In fact, good judgment is a key criterion for success with us. </p></li><li><p>An interest in technological progress, the curiosity to truly understand how things work, and the confidence to contribute your questions and ideas to a highly motivated team.</p></li><li><p>Excellent German and good English skills. French is a big plus. </p></li></ul><p><strong>Above all, we value your mindset:</strong> you learn quickly, ask thoughtful questions and think ahead. You take initiative, develop suggestions and seek support when you need it. You care about the details, strive to make good work even better and are willing to take a risk sometimes to try something new - even when that means making a mistake and learning from it.</p><p><strong>What you can expect</strong></p><p><strong>High standards - and an environment of smart, kind people to challenge you to grow.</strong><br>We are ambitious, give direct, constructive feedback and support one another. Excellence shows up in our everyday work: in thoughtful solutions, careful execution and the drive to keep improving.</p><p><strong>A view of th