vante Microsoft-Zertifikate wie Microsoft 365 Certified: Enterprise Administrator Expert, Microsoft Certified: Cybersecurity Architect Expert (SC-100) oder Information Protection Administrator (SC-400)</li><li>Fliessend in Deutsch und Englisch</li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/coopers-group-ag/m365-cloud-architektin-enterprise-isolation-security-zurich-148849","tags":["Remote","IT"],"job_types":["Befristeter arbeitsvertrag","contract","berufserfahren"],"location":"Zürich","created_at":1793203253},{"slug":"senior-aml-cft-compliance-officer-zurich-230250","company_name":"RULEMATCH AG","title":"Senior AML/CFT Compliance Officer","description":"<p>RULEMATCH has built a digital assets trading and clearing venue with world-class partners to meet the specific needs of regulated financial institutions. By offering significantly more capital-efficient and lower latency trading, RULEMATCH is helping increase institutional adoption and enable the next evolution of the crypto and digital asset market.</p><p>To strengthen our compliance function, RULEMATCH AG, based in Zürich, Switzerland, is looking for a <strong>Senior AML/CFT Compliance Officer</strong>.</p><p>In this role, you will play a key part in ensuring the effectiveness and ongoing development of RULEMATCH’s AML/CFT framework. You will combine hands-on compliance expertise with sound regulatory judgement, taking ownership of key compliance processes and contributing to a robust control environment in a dynamic and evolving regulatory landscape.</p><h2>Tasks</h2><ul><li><p>Take ownership of the ongoing monitoring, maintenance and enhancement of the AML/CFT framework to ensure compliance with applicable legal and regulatory requirements.</p></li><li><p>Develop, draft, review and maintain internal AML/CFT policies, procedures and controls.</p></li><li><p>Over