ng priorities and work flexibly when required.</p></li><li><p>An open-minded, solution-oriented attitude, strong communication skills and a collaborative mindset.</p></li><li><p>A genuine interest in technology and in optimising compliance systems, processes and technical implementations.</p></li></ul><h2>Benefits</h2><ul><li><p>Annual salary of CHF 150’000 and additional stock appreciation rights to participate in the increase in value of the company.</p></li><li><p>Be part of a venture in a fast-growing market with the ambition to compete with the world's best.</p></li><li><p>Inspiring environment with a focus on excellence, teamwork, and transparency.</p></li><li><p>Competitive pension plan benefits.</p></li></ul><p>Please note that only direct applications will be considered for this position.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/rulematch-ag/senior-aml-cft-compliance-officer-zurich-230250","tags":["Compliance","Security"],"job_types":["Indefinite contract (unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag)","professional / experienced"],"location":"Zürich","created_at":1793203252},{"slug":"staff-incubation-engineer-3-zurich-18010","company_name":"Snyk","title":"Staff Incubation Engineer-3","description":"<h2><strong>Unleash AI Innovators, Securely</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Software is being rewritten in real time. AI agents are starting to write more code than humans do, at a speed no security team has ever had to match, and that single shift is opening up the biggest opportunity our industry has seen in a decade. We're not bracing for it, we're building the company that owns it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Snyk is building the next generation security platform where security isn't a set of tools people operate.  It's a team of security agents working alongside your engineers, finding, fixing, and governing risk at the speed software is now built. These