"BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8"><strong>Technical leadership:&nbsp;</strong>You help teams navigate hard technical problems, guide trade-off discussions, and resolve cross-team impediments. You support architects, team leads, and engineers in reaching effective and sustainable technical decisions, when required.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8"><strong>Delivery</strong>: Own the predictable delivery of product outcomes, balancing speed, quality and long-term sustainability.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8"><strong>Quality across the lifecycle: </strong>Build quality from the start through clear standards, test strategy, automation, security, serviceability and evidence-based release readiness.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8"><strong>Outcomes and metrics:</strong> You define OKRs and KPIs for the domain that align with the company's strategic objectives and use them to drive decisions and improvement.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8"><strong>Operational excellence</strong>: Drive modern engineering practices, automation and AI to improve delivery, quality and efficiency, ensuring consistent adoption of the operating model.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8"><strong>Capacity and cost: </strong>Ensure engineering capacity and investment are aligned with priorities and used effectively.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8"><strong>People, performance and growth: </strong>Build a high-performing engineering organization with strong leadership, clear accountability, and the capabilities needed for the future. Drive performance, succession, and talent development.</p></li></ul> <br> <ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8">10+ years in software or product development, of which at least 5 in an engineering management or director role, or equivalent.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8">Bachelor’s degree or higher in Software Engineering, Electrical Engineering, or equivalent experience.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8">Technical experience in embedded systems, cloud platforms or complex IoT products.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8">A track record of delivering complex, multi-team products predictably and to the expected quality standards</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8">Experience building engineering organizations: hiring, personal development, designing accountability, and raising the bar for engineering excellence.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8">Leadership with radical ownership: you take responsibility for results, surface problems early, and drive decisions through to closure.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8">Outcome-based mindset.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8">Strong systems thinking, with the ability to connect product, architecture, quality, delivery, organizational design and commercial constraints.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8">Strong stakeholder management and communication skills.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189166360 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189166360 BCX8">Proven track record or strong affinity in using AI to improve productivity of the product development organization. </p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#595959">What do we offer?</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>Opportunity to shape both the technical future and team culture at a tech company with a strong impact.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW167112962 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW167112962 BCX8">Competitive compensation and benefits package, including a pension plan.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW167112962 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW167112962 BCX8">A healthy work-life balance: flexible working hours, 30 holiday days per year, with the option to purchase more.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW167112962 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW167112962 BCX8">Learning and development opportunities with personal budget for professional growth.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW167112962 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW167112962 BCX8">Healthy cafeteria options and a free on-site fitness center with CrossFit, Pilates, Spinning classes, table tennis and football.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/priva/engineering-director-building-automation-de-lier-312369","tags":["Tech & Data"],"job_types":["Manager","fulltime permanent"],"location":"De Lier, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793212276},{"slug":"staff-frontend-engineer-de-lier-72329","company_name":"Priva","title":"Staff Frontend Engineer","description":"<p><strong>** While we welcome interest from all over the world, we have a local-for-local recruitment policy so the preferred candidate lives close to the office in de Lier.</strong> **</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>"The best way to predict the future is to invent it." — Alan Kay</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>About Priva</strong> <br><br>Priva is a global leader in climate, water, and energy technology solutions for controlled environment horticulture and building automation.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Position Summary As Staff Frontend Engineer</strong> </p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal">You are the technical visionary and practice lead driving frontend craftsmanship across Product Development, Horticulture, and Building Automation. While staying hands-on with modern tech, your primary focus is strategic: scaling architectures, defining roadmaps, and elevating engineering standards.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>Technical Strategy &amp; Architecture: Set the long-term frontend vision, shape architectural designs, and drive the tooling roadmap to meet non-functional requirements (NFRs).</p></li><li><p>Standards &amp; Governance: Define coding standards, design systems, and strategies for code evolution, SDLC security, and multi-team branching/deployment.</p></li><li><p>Cross-Org Leadership &amp; Innovation: Lead technical direction across domains, evaluate third-party frameworks, and pioneer new technologies.</p></li><li><p>Mentorship &amp; Community: Act as frontend practice lead, mentoring senior engineers, running chapters and guilds, and representing Priva in external tech communities.</p></li></ul> <br> <p class="MsoNormal"><strong>What You’ll Bring</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>Languages &amp; Web Fundamentals: Expert-level JavaScript and TypeScript, paired with modern HTML, CSS, and web standards.</p></li><li><p>Angular &amp; Reactive Stack: Deep mastery of Angular architecture (DI, change detection, routing, forms) and advanced RxJS reactive programming.</p></li><li><p>State Management: Extensive production experience with NgRx and Redux-based state management patterns.</p></li><li><p>Testing &amp; Quality Assurance: Comprehensive end-to-end and unit testing strategies using Playwright and Jest.</p></li><li><p>Architecture &amp; Tooling: Proven expertise in CI/CD pipelines, web performance optimization (Lighthouse, Web Vitals), secure coding, and accessibility (a11y).</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><br><strong>What You Will Get</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>Competitive salary depending on experience</p></li><li><p>30 vacation days + option to buy extra</p></li><li><p>8% holiday allowance</p></li><li><p>Travel reimbursement (€0.23/km or full public transport)</p></li><li><p>Pension plan &amp; participation plan</p></li><li><p>Personal development budget</p></li><li><p>Healthy cafeteria</p></li><li><p>Free on-site gym: CrossFit, Pilates, Spinning, table tennis &amp; more</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/priva/staff-frontend-engineer-de-lier-72329","tags":["Tech & Data"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"De Lier, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793212276},{"slug":"senior-backend-engineer-energy-optimization-platform-de-lier-6206","company_name":"Priva","title":"Senior Backend Engineer – Energy Optimization & Platform","description":"<p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">At Priva Energy, we build software systems that help customers manage and optimize energy in real-world environments, from greenhouses to buildings. You'll join one of our </span><strong><span style="color:#254A5D">Energy Solutions teams</span></strong><span style="color:#254A5D"> (spanning Building Automation, Horticulture, and Energy Flexibility Trading), landing wherever the need is greatest at the time, and you'll also carry some responsibility for the cloud infrastructure and scalability that benefits teams beyond your own.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">You'll work at the intersection of three things: </span><strong><span style="color:#254A5D">shipping features</span></strong><span style="color:#254A5D"> end-to-end in Priva Digital Services (touching both backend and, where needed, the front end), </span><strong><span style="color:#254A5D">integrating</span></strong><span style="color:#254A5D"> optimization and forecasting logic into </span><strong><span style="color:#254A5D">production services</span></strong><span style="color:#254A5D">, and strengthening the </span><strong><span style="color:#254A5D">cloud/DevOps foundation</span></strong><span style="color:#254A5D"> the whole department builds on. You don't need to be equally deep in all three, but you do need to be comfortable moving between them, and you should genuinely enjoy the connective, systems-level work of making things run reliably in production.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#254A5D">Come Shape the Future of Sustainable Energy with Priva</span></strong><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><em><span style="color:#254A5D">Priva Energy is working to become the leading global lifecycle partner for high-performing, sustainable buildings, horticultural operations, and energy distribution and management companies. Energy systems are transforming fast: grid congestion, dynamic pricing, decentralized production, and tightening sustainability regulation are reshaping what our customers need from us. Our Digital Twin and optimization technologies exist to meet that shift at scale, delivering measurable results such as lower energy intensity, greater flexibility and reliability, reduced operating costs, and structurally lower emissions.</span></em><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><em><span style="color:#254A5D">As a Senior Backend Engineer, you'll help turn that ambition into production reality: building the services, integrations, and cloud foundation that put our optimization and forecasting capabilities to work for customers every day.</span></em><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#254A5D">Your work will directly contribute to:</span></strong><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Reducing and optimizing energy costs and emissions across Europe&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Enabling customers to participate in future energy flexibility and trading markets&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Optimizing multi-energy systems (heat, cold, electricity, storage, HVAC)&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Driving the transition toward autonomous, intelligent buildings and greenhouses&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Helping customers stay compliant with increasing regulatory pressure (e.g., CSRD)&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#254A5D">What You’ll Do</span></strong><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><u><span style="color:#254A5D">Priva Digital Services &amp; product engineering</span></u><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Design and build backend services that process data and execute optimization logic for products across Neo Heat, Neo Light, Neo Building, and Neo Smart&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Contribute to user-facing Priva Digital Services features end-to-end, including front-end work where it's the fastest path to shipping value&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Build and maintain APIs for internal and external integration&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><u><span style="color:#254A5D">Optimization &amp; forecasting integration</span></u><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Implement and integrate optimization and forecasting logic into scalable, production-ready systems. You bring these models into production; you don't develop new optimization theory&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Work on data processing pipelines, scheduling logic, and system orchestration&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><u><span style="color:#254A5D">Cloud infrastructure &amp; DevOps</span></u><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Own and improve cloud infrastructure (Azure) that supports scalability across Energy Solutions teams&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Strengthen CI/CD, monitoring, and deployment practices so systems are reliable, performant, and maintainable in real-world operation&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Collaborate with product, domain experts, and other engineers across teams to deliver end-to-end solutions&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Contribute to technical design decisions within your domain, and participate in the full software lifecycle: ideation → design → development → testing → deployment → monitoring&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#254A5D">What you will NOT do</span></strong><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">This is not a research or modelling role. You implement and integrate optimization and forecasting models rather than developing new theory&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW34815644 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW34815644 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">You are not expected to be a dedicated front-end specialist or a dedicated DevOps specialist. The role spans these areas by design, so depth in every direction isn't the bar&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW261060845 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">A bachelor's degree in an IT-related field&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW261060845 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Around 5 years of experience in a software engineering role, with demonstrated range across at least two of the following: backend/production systems, cloud infrastructure, front-end, or optimization integration. Versatility across these areas matters more here than deep tenure in a single one&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW261060845 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">You've taken systems into production and kept them running, and can show or talk us through examples (work projects, open source, side projects)&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW261060845 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Experience with one or more of the following is a significant advantage: Python, Azure, Docker, Kubernetes/CI-CD tooling, SQL, KQL, Linux, and front-end frameworks (e.g., React/TypeScript)&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW261060845 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">You are based in the Netherlands and are available to be in the office two to three days per week&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW261060845 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Strong problem-solving skills and a willingness to work with complex, unfamiliar systems&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW261060845 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">A passion for creating customer value through high-quality engineering&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW261060845 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Curiosity, ownership, craftsmanship, and the drive to keep learning&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW261060845 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">Good communication skills, able to explain trade-offs clearly to both engineers and non-technical stakeholders&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW261060845 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">A good vibe: you bring energy to the team and make collaboration genuinely enjoyable, not just effective&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#254A5D">What We Offer You</span></strong><span style="color:#254A5D">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">💶 Excellent remuneration, competitive and aligned with experience&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">🌴 30 days holiday per year, with the option to buy 5 extra at half price &nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">🏦 Excellent pension contribution &nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">🎓 €1,000 education budget per year &nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">⏰ Flexible working hours, and location. &nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">🍱 On-site canteen (e.g., poke bowl for €2) &nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">🏋️ Free onsite gym- with personal trainer. &nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">🎉 A vibrant, open culture where you can be yourself &nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">🌿 Human- and values-driven work, not corporate bureaucracy &nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW261060845 BCX8"><span style="color:#254A5D">🍻 Twice-weekly drinks on Thursdays and Fridays&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/priva/senior-backend-engineer-energy-optimization-platform-de-lier-6206","tags":["Tech & Data"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"De Lier, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793212276},{"slug":"senior-hr-advisor-senior-hr-adviseur-de-lier-339089","company_name":"Priva","title":"Senior HR advisor / Senior HR Adviseur","description":"<h3>Maak impact op HR, organisatie en medewerkers</h3><p>Wil jij als <strong>Senior HR Advisor</strong> complexe HR-vraagstukken vertalen naar praktisch en toekomstgericht HR-beleid? En krijg je energie van adviseren, verbeteren én zelf de handen uit de mouwen steken?</p><p>Bij Priva werk je nauw samen met onze HR Business Partners, HR Director en HR Operations-collega's. Je bent een ervaren sparringpartner voor het HR-team en de business en draagt bij aan complexe HR-casuïstiek, organisatieontwikkeling en strategische HR-projecten.</p><p>Je combineert een brede HR-expertise met een praktische aanpak. Van arbeidsrecht en verzuim tot HR-processen, beleid, data en systemen: jij weet wat er nodig is om onze HR-dienstverlening continu te verbeteren.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW97518420 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#4F81BD">Wat ga je doen?</span></strong></p><p>Als <strong>Senior HR Advisor</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>adviseer je over complexe HR-vraagstukken, arbeidsrecht, verzuim, arbeidsvoorwaarden en organisatieveranderingen;</p></li><li><p>ondersteun je HR Business Partners en management bij individuele en collectieve HR-casuïstiek;</p></li><li><p>draag je bij aan strategische HR-projecten rondom onder andere cultuur, organisatieontwikkeling, transformatie en HR-beleid;</p></li><li><p>vertaal je HR-strategie en wet- en regelgeving naar duidelijke en werkbare processen en oplossingen;</p></li><li><p>werk je samen met HR Operations aan een professionele en efficiënte HR-dienstverlening;</p></li><li><p>analyseer en verbeter je HR-processen en systemen;</p></li><li><p>zet je HR-data en technologie in om betere beslissingen en procesverbeteringen mogelijk te maken;</p></li><li><p>werk je actief met HR-systemen zoals <strong>AFAS</strong> en kijk je verder dan alleen de gebruikerskant om processen slimmer in te richten.</p></li></ul> <br> <p class="Paragraph SCXW97518420 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#4F81BD">Wie ben jij?&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p>Je bent een ervaren HR-professional die gemakkelijk schakelt tussen strategie, advies en uitvoering. Je hebt een stevige inhoudelijke HR-basis, maar kijkt tegelijkertijd verder: waar kunnen processen beter, welke impact heeft een verandering op de organisatie en wat hebben managers en medewerkers nodig?</p><p>Je bent kritisch wanneer dat nodig is, praktisch wanneer het kan en weet verschillende stakeholders mee te nemen in veranderingen.</p><p>Daarnaast breng je mee: </p><ul><li><p>een afgeronde hbo- of wo-opleiding, bijvoorbeeld HRM, Human Resource Management, Bedrijfskunde of Arbeidsrecht;</p></li><li><p>circa 3 tot 6 jaar relevante HR-ervaring, bijvoorbeeld als Senior HR Advisor, HR Adviseur of in een vergelijkbare brede HR-rol;</p></li><li><p>gedegen kennis van het Nederlandse arbeidsrecht en sociale wetgeving;</p></li><li><p>ervaring met complexe HR-casuïstiek, zoals verzuim, reorganisaties en arbeidsvoorwaarden;</p></li><li><p>ervaring met strategische HR-projecten, beleidsontwikkeling of organisatieverandering;</p></li><li><p>het vermogen om strategisch te adviseren én betrokken te blijven bij de operationele HR-praktijk;</p></li><li><p>affiniteit met HR-technologie, HR-data, AFAS en procesoptimalisatie;</p></li><li><p>uitstekende beheersing van de Nederlandse en Engelse taal;</p></li><li><p>beschikbaarheid van 32 tot 40 uur per week.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#147ab6">Wat bieden wij?</span></strong><br>In cijfers:</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221039300 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221039300 BCX8">Een bruto salaris tussen €4.000,00 en €5.000,00 (op basis van je ervaring);</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221039300 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221039300 BCX8">Een gezonde balans tussen werk en privé vinden wij belangrijk: 30 vakantiedagen per jaar en de mogelijkheid om meer bij te kopen;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221039300 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221039300 BCX8">8% vakantiegeld;</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW221039300 BCX8" style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW221039300 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><em>Voor je eigen duurzaamheid:</em></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221039300 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221039300 BCX8">Maak gratis en onbeperkt gebruik van onze eigen sportruimte "The Box" op de Priva Campus, met diverse lessen in bijvoorbeeld CrossFit, Pilates en Spinning;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221039300 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221039300 BCX8">Deelname aan de pensioenregeling van Priva;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW221039300 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW221039300 BCX8">Opleidingsmogelijkheden via onze eigen Priva Academy.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Klaar om jouw HR-expertise in te zetten én écht invloed te hebben op hoe we HR binnen Priva verder ontwikkelen?</strong> Breng je strategische blik, praktische aanpak en verbetermentaliteit mee en bouw samen met ons aan een HR-organisatie die klaar is voor de toekomst. </p><p><strong>Solliciteer als Senior HR Advisor en maak het verschil vanaf dag één.</strong></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/priva/senior-hr-advisor-senior-hr-adviseur-de-lier-339089","tags":["People","Culture and Organization"],"job_types":["Mid","parttime permanent"],"location":"De Lier, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793212276},{"slug":"werkstudent-fulfillment-de-lier-16593","company_name":"Priva","title":"Werkstudent Fulfillment","description":"<p>Ben jij een HBO- of WO-student in een bedrijfseconomische en/of logistieke richting en wil je naast je studie relevante werkervaring opdoen? Bij Priva krijg je de kans om mee te werken aan verschillende projecten binnen een innovatieve en internationale organisatie. </p><p class="Paragraph SCXW135947404 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW121312199 BCX8"><strong>Wat ga je doen?</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW121312199 BCX8">Als werkstudent binnen Fulfilment ondersteun je verschillende teams en werk je mee aan projecten. Je gaat de ene keer aan de slag binnen één specifieke afdeling<s><span style="color:#0078D4">,</span></s> en de andere keer ga je meewerken aan projecten die meerdere afdelingen raken. Fulfilment bestaat uit de afdelingen Production, Logistics &amp; Warehousing, Supplier Quality Engineering en Procurement &amp; Planning.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW121312199 BCX8">Afhankelijk van het project houd je je onder andere bezig met:</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW121312199 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW121312199 BCX8">Ondersteunen van collega's bij operationele en administratieve werkzaamheden;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW121312199 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW121312199 BCX8">Meewerken aan lopende projecten binnen de verschillende Fulfilment-afdelingen;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW121312199 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW121312199 BCX8">Verzamelen, analyseren en verwerken van data;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW121312199 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW121312199 BCX8">Signaleren van verbetermogelijkheden en meedenken over efficiëntere processen;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW121312199 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW121312199 BCX8">Zelfstandig oppakken en uitvoeren van (LEAN-)deelprojecten.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW121312199 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW121312199 BCX8">Zo doe je naast je studie waardevolle praktijkervaring op en krijg je de mogelijkheid om jouw kennis direct toe te passen binnen een professionele werkomgeving.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW135947404 BCX8"><strong>Wie zijn wij?</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW135947404 BCX8">Wij zijn Priva! Priva is een familiebedrijf, gevestigd in het Westland. Het is de missie van Priva om een optimale omgeving te creëren waarin zowel planten als mensen kunnen werken, groeien en zich ontwikkelen. Wij bieden wereldwijde oplossingen voor de tuinbouw, gebouwautomatisering en alles daartussenin. Wij zijn toonaangevend in de ontwikkeling en productie van technologie voor het optimaliseren van omgevingsomstandigheden en processen.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW135947404 BCX8">Onze ambitie is om bekend te staan als de toonaangevende technologie- en dienstverlener voor duurzame stedelijke delta's. We zijn er trots op dat onze oplossingen resulteren in een lager verbruik van natuurlijke hulpbronnen, zoals energie en water. Om onze missie en ambitie waar te maken, zijn we op zoek naar toegewijde collega's. We zijn er trots op dat we met ruim 500 collega's, in 16 internationale vestigingen verdeeld over 12 landen samen met meer dan 400 internationale installatiepartners werken aan het leveren van onze duurzame oplossingen en diensten in meer dan 100 landen.</p> <br> <p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8"><strong>Wie ben jij?</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Wij zoeken een enthousiaste student die graag kennismaakt met de praktijk en initiatief durft te nemen. </p><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Daarnaast:</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Volg je een HBO- of WO-opleiding in een bedrijfseconomische en/of logistieke richting;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Ben je 16 tot 24 uur per week beschikbaar, in overleg;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Werk je analytisch en nauwkeurig;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Beschik je over goede communicatieve vaardigheden;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Heb je een proactieve en zelfstandige werkhouding;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Beheers je zowel de Nederlandse als Engelse taal goed, mondeling en schriftelijk.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8"><strong>Wat je krijgt?</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Naast een interessante bijbaan waarin je relevante werkervaring opdoet, bieden we je:</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Een uitdagende werkplek waarin je jezelf kunt ontwikkelen en waardevolle praktijkervaring opdoet.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Een passend en&nbsp;marktconform salaris</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Bedrijfsrestaurant tegen betaalbare prijzen, gratis fruit en lekkere koffie in The Hub.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Een actieve personeelsvereniging &amp; vitaliteitsteam met PrivaFit! Workshops waaraan je deel kan nemen.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW80881712 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW80881712 BCX8">Toegang tot onze gratis fitnessfaciliteiten op locatie, waar je kunt meedoen aan Crossfit-, Pilates-, Yoga- en Full Body Workout of speel een potje tafelvoetbal en tafeltennis mee.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW178143151 BCX8"><strong>Solliciteren</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW178143151 BCX8">Wil jij naast je studie relevante werkervaring opdoen en ontdekken hoe het is om binnen Priva Fulfilment aan verschillende projecten te werken? <strong>Solliciteer dan direct!</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/priva/werkstudent-fulfillment-de-lier-16593","tags":["Production & Logistics"],"job_types":["Student college","parttime fixed term"],"location":"De Lier, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793212276},{"slug":"security-architect-de-lier-439156","company_name":"Priva","title":"Security Architect","description":"<p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8">Are you a security specialist in the OT space looking to expand your expertise into cloud solutions? Are you a cloud security champion passionate about bringing your expertise into OT/IoT space? At <strong>Priva Product Development Organisation </strong>we are looking for the <strong>Security Architect</strong> who will shape the security of our products.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8"> &nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8"><strong>Security Architect in Priva Product Development – Why this role matters</strong>&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8">At Priva, we develop hardware products and software services for horticulture and building automation. Seeing the importance of our products for our customers, we recognize the need to continuously keep these secure in the ever evolving, fast-paced world. The security requirements in our landscape span four different areas:&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ol class="NumberListStyle1 SCXW48555210 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8">Physical/embedded device security.&nbsp;</p></li></ol><ol start="2" class="NumberListStyle1 SCXW48555210 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8">OT (operational technology) network security.&nbsp;</p></li></ol><ol start="3" class="NumberListStyle1 SCXW48555210 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8">OT network to Priva-hosted cloud services communications.&nbsp;</p></li></ol><ol start="4" class="NumberListStyle1 SCXW48555210 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8">Priva's hybrid on-prem/multi-cloud platform applications security, including applications, infrastructure, CI/CD pipelines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ol><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8">What makes this role truly unique is that our products contain long-lived hardware components that our customers run for years. Engineering future-proofed security solutions and maintaining a security posture at existing sites across all these areas having wide range of varying implementations and security needs creates a great challenge and a great fun.&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8">As part of the architecture team, you will play a key role in shaping the future of Priva's portfolio offered on the global market. You define security standards, security practices and security designs for our products that are used in tens of thousands of buildings and greenhouses. You work across product, engineering, and operations teams to ensure security controls and adhered to, implemented and tested as you have designed these. That’s real impact.&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8"><strong>What you will be doing</strong>&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8">As a Security Architect, you have a very simple mission: you see to it that Priva's hardware products and software (cloud) services are secured against known and emergent threats in lines with the industry standards and practices. You build upon your strong background in securing device/OT networks, cloud applications, and engraining the security practices in the daily work of Agile teams to achieve consistent security posture across all Priva products, designs, and customer deployments.&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW48555210 BCX8"> As a security architect, you are trusted counterpart of Priva Security, Quality, and Compliance officer to define, review, and execute controls arising from ISO9001 and ISO27001 standards and internal initiatives. You are responsible for presenting the necessary evidence of Priva’s compliance with these controls to the auditors.&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW131319278 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW131319278 BCX8">Security standards, policies, and design patterns library&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW131319278 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW131319278 BCX8">Security architecture review process&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW131319278 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW131319278 BCX8">Risk register and residual risk acceptance documentation&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW131319278 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW131319278 BCX8">Periodic product security implementation reviews, including maintaining non-compliance register&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW131319278 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW131319278 BCX8">Defined requirements, products and work packages for security-focused projects with 3rd party service providers, reviewing and accepting their deliverables, and supervising the implementation of these deliverables in the Priva hardware products and software services.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW131319278 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW131319278 BCX8">Regulatory compliance (IEC 62443-4, ISO 27001, ISO 9001 or other standard that may be applicable in specific geographies)&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW131319278 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW131319278 BCX8">Threat intelligence briefing relevant to OT/IoT threat landscape&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW131319278 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW131319278 BCX8">Designing, implementing, and reviewing security controls applied at major customer sites.&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW131319278 BCX8">Above all, this is a hands-on role – occasionally writing code is included. You connect the industry’s best practices, ISO standards, product vision with the daily work of the product team. As a security architect, you practice what you preach. You explain, coach, and show by example the implementation of security as Secure SDLC in the developer’s daily work.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8"><strong>To succeed in this role:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">You are passionate about OT security; you have great interest in the application of our products in the field. You are curious to grasp how our products truly work for our customers to find the best balance between security, reliability, and cost. You share the opinion that "if I don't secure Priva’s applications, then no one else will".&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">You identify and eliminate issues in the development cycle that can jeopardize the security posture. You know and can show by example how to "test <em>securely</em> as well as test <em>security</em>"&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">You are a great collaborator who can be a valuable sparring partner with product managers to understand and refine customer's needs for security so that you define the right security designs for market segments. Engineering managers rely on your ability to steer security implementations within the product teams.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">You are comfortable designing products that our customers will be running for years; comfortable providing guidance to LCM activities for existing customers to update hardware and software components to continuously stay secure.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">You share the knowledge about security subjects; you explain why security practices exist and what they achieve in the long run.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">You can translate security designs into engineering specifications, appraise implementation designs, conduct code reviews. This role with a strong hands-on component, not just a pure governance role.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">You understand and can register, document, and communicate clearly risks and trade-offs between differen t project execution scenarios&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">You have had hands-on experience implementing security designs using modern programming language and frameworks, and you are able to coach product teams to increase their secure coding maturity e.g. by running threat modelling workshops with the engineering team.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">You have vast experience with architecture roles with 3-5 years of experience specifically focusing on security.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">In addition, you have the following technical expertise:&nbsp;</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">Proven track record across at least two of the three domains: OT/IoT/embedded security, network security, cloud security&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">You are familiar with modern authentication and authorization frameworks (JWT, OpenID, SAML) and (REST) API security and protection approached&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">ISO 27001 and IEC 62443-4 understanding at a working level&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">Working knowledge with or excellent ability to apply the PKI and certificate lifecycle management at scale; also, with the vision how to implement this in OT/IoT deployment contexts&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">Solid network security understanding: firewall policy, micro-segmentation, DMZ design for IT/OT boundaries&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">Zero trust architecture principles&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">Secure SDLC and DevSecOps tools and practices (think about OWASP, SANS25, Snyk, Black Duck, etc)&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8"> &nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8"><strong>The following competence is desired:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">OT/ICS protocols and architectures (such as BACnet Secure Connect, Modbus, DNP3, MQTT, AMQP)&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">Embedded device security for industrial PCs, systems-on-chip, and microcontrollers: secure boot, hardware security modules (HSMs), TPM, secure enclave concepts, firmware &amp; data signing, encryption&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">Cloud security on at least one major platform (AWS, Azure, or GCP)&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">Container and Kubernetes security&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">Secrets management and key management systems (HashiCorp Vault, AWS KMS, Azure Key Vault)&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW62144440 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW62144440 BCX8">Priva's technical stack is C#/C++/.NET and Angular. Experience implementing production projects with this stack is preferred, but not required if you are able to learn it quickly (based on your vast experience)&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW170785910 BCX8"><strong>What we offer you</strong>&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW170785910 BCX8"> &nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW170785910 BCX8">💶 <strong>Excellent remuneration</strong> — competitive and aligned with experience.&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW170785910 BCX8">🌴 <strong>30 days holiday</strong> per year, with the option to buy 5 more at half price.&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW170785910 BCX8">🏦 <strong>Excellent pension contribution</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW170785910 BCX8">🎓 <strong>Education budget</strong> of €1,000 per year.&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW170785910 BCX8">⏰ <strong>Flexible working hours</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW170785910 BCX8">🍱 <strong>Onsite canteen</strong> (e.g., poke bowl for €2).&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW170785910 BCX8">🏋️ <strong>Free onsite gym</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW170785910 BCX8">🎉 <strong>Vibrant, open culture</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/priva/security-architect-de-lier-439156","tags":["Tech & Data"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"De Lier, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793212276},{"slug":"legal-ai-growth-manager-amsterdam-16483","company_name":"Saga","title":"Legal AI Growth Manager","description":"<p>Saga is a legal innovation company on a mission to remove the friction between legal expertise and real-world impact, so lawyers can focus on what matters the most: people, ethics, and impact. Founded in Norway and built for the legal profession from day one, we integrate with local legal sources across multiple jurisdictions and are currently available in 12 languages. In just 18 months, we've grown to 80+ employees and 5,000+ users across 20+ countries - with market leadership in Norway and The Netherlands, and active expansion across Europe. We believe technology shouldn't replace legal reasoning, but strengthen it - so the law can work as it's meant to: aligned, accountable, and capable of delivering justice for everyone.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>As we grow, we're looking for someone at an unusual and valuable intersection: a legal professional ready to step into thought leadership, marketing, growth, and technology - and help us speak credibly to legal professionals while opening doors into the communities where they already gather.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Your role as a Legal AI Growth Manager</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW223953155 BCX0">Building trust in the legal profession starts with understanding the people behind it. That's why we're looking for a legal professional who can help Saga build meaningful relationships, strengthen our presence in the Dutch legal market and connect with the communities where legal professionals exchange ideas and knowledge.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW223953155 BCX0">As Saga's first <strong>Legal AI Growth Manager</strong>, you'll join the Marketing &amp; Growth team and work closely with Legal Engineering, Sales and Product. This role is an opportunity for a jurist, paralegal, legal counsel or lawyer who's curious about taking their career beyond traditional legal practice, bringing their legal expertise and professional network into the world of technology, marketing and growth.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW223953155 BCX0"><strong>This is a new role with room to shape it.</strong> You'll have the freedom to explore ideas, build initiatives from the ground up and develop approaches that can grow with Saga.</p> <br> <p><strong>What you'll be doing</strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189851475 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189851475 BCX0"><strong>Build relationships and partnerships</strong> with lawyers, law firms, bar associations, alumni networks and legal innovators across the Netherlands.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189851475 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189851475 BCX0"><strong>Create thought leadership and educational content</strong>, translating legal insights and practical AI use cases into relevant articles, interviews and campaigns.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189851475 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189851475 BCX0"><strong>Grow the legal community</strong> through roundtables, workshops, webinars and networking initiatives.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189851475 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189851475 BCX0"><strong>Represent Saga at legal events and conferences</strong>, building connections and identifying new opportunities.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189851475 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189851475 BCX0"><strong>Bring market insights and customer feedback</strong> into Marketing, Product and Legal Engineering.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189851475 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189851475 BCX0"><strong>Support go-to-market and product marketing</strong>, working with Sales and Marketing to communicate Saga's value to legal professionals.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW189851475 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW189851475 BCX0"><strong>Develop advocacy initiatives</strong> that turn engaged customers and community members into long-term champions of Saga.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>What you'll bring</strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW45492367 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW45492367 BCX0">A legal education and professional experience as a lawyer, jurist, legal counsel, paralegal or in a similar role.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW45492367 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW45492367 BCX0">Familiarity with the Dutch legal market and connections through professional associations, networks or industry events.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW45492367 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW45492367 BCX0">Strong communication and storytelling skills, with the ability to make legal and technical topics clear and engaging.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW45492367 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW45492367 BCX0">A natural ability to connect people, build relationships and create opportunities</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW45492367 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW45492367 BCX0">An entrepreneurial mindset, curiosity and confidence to take initiative.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW45492367 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW45492367 BCX0">Hands-on experience with AI tools and an interest in how they're changing legal practice.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW45492367 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW45492367 BCX0"><strong>Native or near-native Dutch</strong> and fluent English.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Our team &amp; culture</strong></p><p>We're a team of lawyers, engineers, designers, and builders across multiple countries, with a startup mindset - flexible, fast-moving, and focused on what matters. We don't believe in rigid structures or unnecessary processes, but we do believe in discipline: showing up consistently, following through, and holding ourselves to a high standard.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Outside of work, many of us are active in sports - running, skiing, hiking - not as a mandate, but because we're drawn to the same mindset sport builds: consistency, resilience, and a long-term view. If you thrive in a flat, high-ownership environment, you'll feel right at home.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Why join Saga</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW146048033 BCX0"><strong>Take your legal career in a new direction, without leaving your expertise behind.</strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW146048033 BCX0">You'll join an international team of lawyers, engineers, builders, and commercial professionals working to make legal AI genuinely useful and accessible. We keep structures light, encourage ownership and give people room to experiment, learn and make an impact.&nbsp;</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW57790211 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW57790211 BCX0"><strong>Salary:</strong> Up to €5,500 gross per month (all-inclusive, based on a 40-hour week), depending on experience.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW57790211 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW57790211 BCX0"><strong>Career development:</strong> A transition into legal tech, marketing and growth, with support and mentorship.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW57790211 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW57790211 BCX0"><strong>Ownership:</strong> The opportunity to shape a new role and build initiatives from the ground up.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW57790211 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW57790211 BCX0"><strong>Learning budget:</strong> An annual budget for courses, conferences and development.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW57790211 BCX0"><strong>Flexibility:</strong> Hybrid working with our Amsterdam hub.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW57790211 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW57790211 BCX0"><strong>International team:</strong> An English-first environment with Norwegian roots and a growing European presence.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><img style="width:2645px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/enkt6vhyts2krhhuu7t7p844knknld/Frame_27.png"></figure><p><br></p><p><strong>Our process</strong></p><figure><img style="width:2645px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/hou9nnmfv8lgc2ypfdlkk4kw1ku9tw/V3_Process_Visual.png"></figure><p class="p2">If all this sounds like y