&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/purestorage/account-executive-portworx-strategic-accounts-telco-emea-amsterdam-355270","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1793148924},{"slug":"senior-technical-success-manager-435059","company_name":"zscaler","title":"Senior Technical Success Manager","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt; We are looking for a Technical Success Manager to join our team. This is a remote role based in Netherlands reporting to the Senior Manager, Technical Success Management in the Customer Success Organization department. You will guide customers through their Zero Trust journey as the central post-sales point of contact, helping customers adopt and maximize Zscaler&#39;s solutions to secure their digital transformation objectives. Your role centers on providing expert advice, building relationships, and ensuring successful solution adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;Understand customer goals, challenges, and technical needs to align with Zscaler solutions and drive satisfaction&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;Build relationships with stakeholders, conduct reviews, and identify growth opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;Anticipate challenges, provide proactive recommendations, and mitigate risks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Maintain deep understanding of Zscaler products and contribute to internal and customer-facing Knowledge Base best practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Support, and Product teams to deliver a seamless customer experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in customer-facing roles with a blend of technical expertise and account management, including product feature implementations and best-practice adoption&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience troubleshooting network issues and familiarity with tools such as Ping, Traceroute, and MTR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;Knowledge of ISO/OSI protocols including HTTP, SSL/TLS, FTP, and DNS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel approximately 10% for customer-related requirements, with travel costs fully reclaimed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience utilizing AI-powered customer success platforms or predictive analytics tools to proactively identify customer adoption risks, anticipate technical escalations, and optimize retention strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Experience running discovery discussions, building High/Low level design, and managing large-scale deployments or migrations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;In-depth understanding of enterprise networks, cloud security technologies like SASE, SSE, and ZTNA, and authentication protocols such as SAML, LDAP, and OAuth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;#LI-MP1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Zscaler’s salary ranges are benchmarked and determined by role and level. The range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire base salaries for this position across all Netherlands locations. Individual pay placement within this range is determined based on objective, gender-neutral criteria including job-related skills, relevant experience, and education or training. The base salary range listed for this full-time position excludes commission/bonus/equity (if applicable) and benefits. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€75.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/zscaler/senior-technical-success-manager-435059","tags":["Customer Success"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1793148919},{"slug":"senior-director-of-engineering-civil-government-and-commercial-haarlem-233936","company_name":"planetlabs","title":"Senior Director of Engineering - Civil Government and Commercial","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced engineering leader to become our Senior Director of Engineering for Civil Government and Commercial. In this role, you will lead the engineering strategy, execution, and team development for a rapidly growing organization of 70+ engineers spanning multiple global Planet offices. You will oversee the development, scaling, and delivery of our critical existing solutions, including Area Monitoring Service (AMS) for EU Common Agricultural Policy (CAP) compliance, Disaster and Wildfire solutions, Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem (CDSE), and a portfolio of Derived Data Products. You will also drive our &quot;zero to one&quot; product discovery, partnering closely with Product Management, Design, and Science teams to incubate, architect, and launch new, emerging solutions built on top of Planet’s high-frequency imagery and derived data products. AI is central to how Planet builds solutions, and you will make it a primary way your teams discover, build, and deliver for customers. This position is vital to delivering innovative applications to civil governments and commercial customers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, hybrid role which will require you to work from our Berlin, Haarlem, or Ljubljana office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and scale a global engineering organization of 70+ engineers, managers, and directors across multiple geographies and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a high bar for performance and accountability. Define measurable outcomes for every product and team, surface risks early and directly, and make the hard calls on people and priorities when results fall short.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the day-to-day engineering execution and delivery for existing flagship products, ensuring reliability and performance for AMS,&amp;nbsp; Disaster and Wildfire solutions, and the derived data portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and lead &quot;zero to one&quot; engineering discovery, building the technical foundation and prototypes for new emerging commercial and civil government products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on a daily basis with Product Management, Design, and GTM teams to define product direction, prioritize feature development, and align technical strategy with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure systems are scalable, reliable, and secure for government and enterprise use, guiding architectural decisions and engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align your team&#39;s daily output with Planet’s mission of using space to help life on earth, directly enabling governments and businesses to make critical, timely decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant software engineering work experience, including 8+ years of supervisory or leadership experience managing multiple layers of engineering management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and scaling distributed engineering teams of 50+ employees across multiple geographic locations and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on engagement with AI tools in your own work, and experience leading engineering teams through AI adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of &quot;zero to one&quot; product development, including the technical discovery, architecture, and successful launch of new software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in building and delivering geospatial platforms, data analytics solutions, or enterprise SaaS products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering tailored solutions to individual customers, meeting or exceeding their expectations and integrating new building blocks back into the solution commons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset. You experiment, learn quickly, and change course when the evidence says to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate with cross-functional partners to translate complex business and user requirements into actionable technical roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience overseeing operational reliability, cloud infrastructure, and software deployment lifecycles for enterprise-grade applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive software delivery metrics, maintain high operational availability/SLAs, and foster rigorous engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to recruit, mentor, and retain engineering talent at all levels while fostering an inclusive team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and effective written and verbal communication skills for engaging with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success building large scale civil government solutions leveraging forward deployed engineering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the unique regulatory, compliance, and security requirements of government technology solutions globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building sovereign systems for governments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€120.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€150.100 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/planetlabs/senior-director-of-engineering-civil-government-and-commercial-haarlem-233936","tags":["Solutions (SWE)"],"job_types":[],"location":"Haarlem","created_at":1793148918},{"slug":"remote-teamleider-werktuigbouwkundige-installaties-barneveld-341180","company_name":"VDK Groep B.V.","title":"Teamleider Werktuigbouwkundige Installaties","description":"<h3>Teamleider Werktuigbouwkundige Installaties</h3><p class="isSelectedEnd">Ben jij een ervaren installatietechnicus die klaar is voor een leidinggevende rol? Of geef je al leiding aan monteurs en wil je meer verantwoordelijkheid binnen de werktuigbouwkundige installatietechniek? Dan hebben we bij Campus Installatietechniek in Barneveld een mooie uitdaging voor je! Als Teamleider Werktuigbouwkundige Installaties combineer je jouw technische kennis met het aansturen en begeleiden van een team monteurs. Je zorgt dat werkzaamheden goed worden voorbereid, projecten volgens planning verlopen en jouw collega's hun werk optimaal kunnen uitvoeren. Je bent de verbindende schakel tussen de monteurs, werkvoorbereiding, projectleiding en opdrachtgevers. Daarbij houd je overzicht, denk je mee over technische oplossingen en zorg je voor een prettige samenwerking.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3>Wat we je bieden</h3><p class="isSelectedEnd">Bij Campus Installatietechniek krijg je de ruimte om verantwoordelijkheid te nemen, jouw team verder te ontwikkelen en mee te bouwen aan mooie installatieprojecten. Daar staat natuurlijk iets tegenover:</p><ul><li><p>Een goed salaris dat past bij jouw kennis, ervaring en verantwoordelijkheden;</p></li><li><p>Een afwisselende functie voor 32 tot 40 uur per week;</p></li><li><p>Veel zelfstandigheid en vrijheid om jouw werkzaamheden te organiseren;</p></li><li><p>Goede secundaire arbeidsvoorwaarden;</p></li><li><p>Afwisselende projecten binnen de utiliteitsbouw en gebouwgebonden installatietechniek;</p></li><li><p>Opleidingen, cursussen en doorgroeimogelijkheden om jezelf verder te ontwikkelen;</p></li><li><p>Moderne middelen en gereedschappen om je werk goed uit te voeren;</p></li><li><p>Een informele werksfeer met betrokken collega's en korte communicatielijnen;</p></li><li><p>De voordelen en ontwikkelmogelijkheden van de VDK Groep, gecombineerd met de persoonlijke sfeer van Campus.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h3>Wat je gaat doen</h3><p class="isSelectedEnd">Als Teamleider Werktuigbouwkundige Installaties ben jij verantwoordelijk voor de dagelijkse aansturing en coördinatie van werkzaamheden binnen verschillende installatieprojecten. Je zorgt dat jouw team weet wat er moet gebeuren en dat projecten veilig, efficiënt en volgens afspraak worden uitgevoerd.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je houdt je onder andere bezig met:</p><ul><li><p>Aansturen, begeleiden en motiveren van monteurs en technici;</p></li><li><p>Coördineren en verdelen van werkzaamheden binnen werktuigbouwkundige installatieprojecten;</p></li><li><p>Bewaken van de planning, voortgang, kwaliteit, veiligheid en kosten;</p></li><li><p>Afstemmen met projectleiders, werkvoorbereiders, opdrachtgevers en leveranciers;</p></li><li><p>Zorgen dat materialen, informatie en middelen tijdig beschikbaar zijn;</p></li><li><p>Meedenken over technische vraagstukken rondom klimaatinstallaties, verwarming en luchtbehandeling;</p></li><li><p>Signaleren van verbeterkansen en bijdragen aan efficiëntere werkprocessen;</p></li><li><p>Onderhouden van goede contacten met klanten en andere betrokken partijen.</p></li></ul><p>Je staat dicht bij de techniek, maar houdt tegelijkertijd het overzicht over het grotere geheel. Dankzij jouw inzet kunnen de monteurs hun werk goed uitvoeren en worden projecten succesvol opgeleverd.</p> <br> <h3>Wat neem je mee?</h3><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je hebt een stevige technische basis binnen de werktuigbouwkundige installatietechniek en vindt het leuk om collega's aan te sturen en verder te helpen. Je kunt goed organiseren, communiceert duidelijk en weet ook bij onverwachte situaties het overzicht te bewaren.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd">Daarnaast herken jij jezelf in het volgende:</p><ul><li><p>Een afgeronde mbo- of hbo-opleiding richting installatietechniek, werktuigbouwkunde of vergelijkbaar;</p></li><li><p>Enkele jaren werkervaring binnen de werktuigbouwkundige installatietechniek, bijvoorbeeld als Eerste Monteur, Leidinggevend Monteur of Teamleider;</p></li><li><p>Kennis van gebouwgebonden installaties, zoals verwarmingsinstallaties, klimaatinstallaties en luchtbehandeling;</p></li><li><p>Leidinggevende kwaliteiten en het vermogen om collega's te motiveren;</p></li><li><p>Organisatorisch inzicht en een goed gevoel voor planning en kwaliteit;</p></li><li><p>Goede communicatieve vaardigheden en een klantgerichte instelling;</p></li><li><p>Een proactieve houding en het vermogen om technische en organisatorische uitdagingen op te lossen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="isSelectedEnd">Heb je ruime ervaring als Eerste Monteur of Leidinggevend Monteur en ben je toe aan een volgende stap? Ook dan komen we graag met je in contact!</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3>Waar ga je het doen?</h3><p class="isSelectedEnd">Campus Installatietechniek is een installatiebedrijf gevestigd in Barneveld. We werken aan uiteenlopende werktuigbouwkundige installaties binnen de utiliteit en gebouwgebonden installatietechniek.Bij Campus houden we van korte lijnen, duidelijke afspraken en een praktische aanpak. We zorgen voor een goede voorbereiding en ondersteunen elkaar waar nodig. Hierdoor kunnen onze monteurs zich richten op hun vak en kunnen projecten efficiënt worden uitgevoerd.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="isSelectedEnd">Als Teamleider krijg je de ruimte om mee te denken, verbeteringen door te voeren en jouw eigen stempel te drukken op de dagelijkse werkzaamheden. Je werkt samen met betrokken collega's die elkaar kennen, helpen en samen zorgen voor tevreden klanten.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="isSelectedEnd">Wij zijn een trots onderdeel van de snelgroeiende VDK Groep (185 bedrijven, 9.000 collega’s), maar opereren met een eigen identiteit en cultuur. Dit betekent dat je bij ons de voordelen van een grote organisatie ervaart – denk aan opleidingsmogelijkheden, een stabiele basis en top secundaire arbeidsvoorwaarden – terwijl je tegelijkertijd de vrijheid, dynamiek en verantwoordelijkheid krijgt om je eigen stempel te drukken bij het lokale bedrijf.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3>Interesse?</h3><p class="isSelectedEnd">Zie jij jezelf al werken als Teamleider Werktuigbouwkundige Installaties bij Campus Installatietechniek? Dan komen we graag met je in contact!</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Heb je vragen over de functie of wil je direct solliciteren? Neem gerust contact op met Didi Koers, Recruitment Business Partner bij de VDK Groep. Bel of app naar 06-13850963 of mail naar <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ----------<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/vdk-groep-bv/remote-teamleider-werktuigbouwkundige-installaties-barneveld-341180","tags":["Management & Staff","Remote"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Werken op afstand","created_at":1793147506},{"slug":"stage-cad-tekenaar-en-werkvoorbereider-installatietechniek-regio-woerden-nieuwerbrug-aan-den-rijn-419997","company_name":"VDK Groep B.V.","title":"Stage CAD Tekenaar en Werkvoorbereider Installatietechniek | Regio Woerden","description":"<p class="isSelectedEnd">Volg jij een mbo-opleiding in de installatietechniek of werktuigbouwkunde en wil je praktijkervaring opdoen binnen de woningbouw? Bij Heating Service Installatie Techniek leer je hoe installaties worden ontworpen, getekend en voorbereid voor uitvoering op de bouw.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je werkt met AutoCAD, ondersteunt de werkvoorbereiding en ontdekt hoe techniek, planning en uitvoering samenkomen binnen echte projecten.</p><h2>Wat ga je doen</h2><ul><li><p>Maken en uitwerken van technische installatietekeningen in AutoCAD</p></li><li><p>Ondersteunen bij het opstellen van materiaallijsten</p></li><li><p>Meewerken aan de werkvoorbereiding van projecten</p></li><li><p>Afstemmen van tekeningen met monteurs en projectleiders</p></li><li><p>Ondersteunen bij lopende woningbouwprojecten</p></li><li><p>Leren hoe installaties worden voorbereid voor uitvoering op de bouw</p></li></ul><h2>Wat wij je bieden</h2><ul><li><p>Een leerzame stage binnen een professioneel installatiebedrijf</p></li><li><p>Intensieve begeleiding door ervaren collega's</p></li><li><p>Een stagevergoeding</p></li><li><p>Veel ruimte om praktijkervaring op te doen</p></li><li><p>Goede software en professionele tools om mee te werken</p></li><li><p>Persoonlijke aandacht voor jouw ontwikkeling</p></li><li><p>Doorgroeimogelijkheden binnen Heating Service en de VDK Groep</p></li><li><p>Gezellige vrijdagmiddagborrels met het team</p></li><li><p>Mooie personeelskortingen bij bekende winkels en gerenommeerde merken</p></li></ul><h2>Wat neem je mee</h2><ul><li><p>Je volgt een mbo-opleiding Werktuigbouwkunde of Installatietechniek</p></li><li><p>Interesse in CAD-tekenen en installatietechniek</p></li><li><p>Een leergierige en gemotiveerde instelling</p></li><li><p>Je woont in de regio Woerden, Gouda of omgeving</p></li><li><p>Rijbewijs B is een pré</p></li></ul><p class="isSelectedEnd">Vink je niet alles af maar heb je wel de motivatie? Dan komen we graag met je in contact.</p><h2>Heating Service Installatie Techniek en de VDK Groep</h2><p class="isSelectedEnd">Heating Service Installatie Techniek is een zelfstandig en familiair installatiebedrijf in Nieuwerbrug aan den Rijn. Dagelijks werken wij aan duurzame installaties voor woningbouwprojecten en investeren we in de ontwikkeling van nieuwe vakmensen.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong>Wat Heating Service onderscheidt:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Sterke focus op woningbouwprojecten</p></li><li><p>Veel aandacht voor begeleiding en ontwikkeling</p></li><li><p>Werken met moderne tools zoals AutoCAD</p></li></ul><p class="isSelectedEnd">Heating Service Installatie Techniek is onderdeel van de VDK Groep, een organisatie met meer dan 110 zelfstandige installatiebedrijven in Nederland.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong>Dat betekent voor jou:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Toegang tot kennis en opleidingen binnen de groep</p></li><li><p>Doorgroeimogelijkheden binnen meerdere bedrijven</p></li><li><p>Werken binnen een financieel sterke en stabiele organisatie</p></li></ul><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je voelt je thuis bij Heating Service, terwijl je kunt bouwen op de kracht en stabiliteit van VDK Groep.</p><h2><strong>Contact</strong></h2><p class="MsoNormal">Heb je interesse? Bel, app of mail gerust met Jonathan Boom, Recruitment Business Partner bij VDK Groep.</p><p class="MsoNormal">06 23243766 | <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- class="MsoNormal">#LI-JB2</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <h4></h4><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/vdk-groep-bv/stage-cad-tekenaar-en-werkvoorbereider-installatietechniek-regio-woerden-nieuwerbrug-aan-den-rijn-419997","tags":["Engineering & Ontwerp"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Nieuwerbrug aan den Rijn, Zuid-Holland, Nederland","created_at":1793147506},{"slug":"chief-information-security-officer-naarden-26308","company_name":"Ockto","title":"Chief Information Security Officer","description":"<h2>Make security the reason people trust Ockto</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Own security at the platform people use to share their most personal data</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Every day, people use Ockto to share their identity, income, assets and bank data: when they apply for a mortgage, rent a home or take out a lease. Banks and other large organisations choose Ockto partly because of the level of assurance we offer around that data. At Ockto, security is not a support function. It is part of the product and organisational culture.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal">As our CISO, you make sure it stays that way as we grow. Part of that growth is adopting an AI driven operating model with strong guardrails. You own Ockto's security programme, from risk and controls to incidents, suppliers and audits. You set the standard, check that it is met, and make security measurable in a way that the whole organisation (and specifically our engineers and spec leads), clients, auditors and regulators all recognise. You do this with a real mandate and short lines to the people who decide.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h2>What you'll do</h2><p class="MsoNormal">You own the information security programme of a supervised financial company and make it work in daily practice, not just on paper. As CISO, you:</p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Own Ockto's ISMS and security policy framework, and keep our ISO 27001 certification (held since 2017) and our SOC 2 assurance current and credible.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Translate the risk appetite set by management into a security strategy, an annual plan and clear standards that teams can build to.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Keep Ockto ahead of what's coming. You track developments such as eIDAS2 and the EU Digital Identity Wallet, NIS2, the Cyber Resilience Act and the AI Act, assess what they mean for Ockto and our clients, and translate them into our security strategy and standards in time.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Verify and challenge. Our engineering teams operate the technical controls; you check that they work and that findings get fixed. You approve risk acceptance for serious vulnerabilities and commission penetration tests. All control owners are challenged and prepared to show evidence and reproduce controls.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Lead the response to security and privacy incidents, approve notifications to regulators, and make sure root causes lead to structural fixes.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Manage security risk in our supply chain, from onboarding new suppliers to the annual review of critical ones, in line with DORA.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Make sure our continuity and recovery arrangements are tested and hold up, together with Engineering.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Make security measurable. We judge it by how quickly and how structurally we resolve what we find, not by counting incidents.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Represent Ockto's security towards clients, auditors and supervisors: from a bank's due diligence questionnaire to our external audits and contact with DNB and AFM.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Build a security-aware culture with an awareness programme people actually remember.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h2>Who you work with</h2><p class="MsoNormal">You report to our Product &amp; Trust Director, who sets Ockto's trust framework and risk appetite. Within that framework, the security strategy and its execution are yours. On security matters you also have a direct line to our CEO, and you are involved early in the product and architecture decisions that shape our risk. Our Information Security Officer is part of your team and runs day-to-day control monitoring with you.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal">You also work closely with our Engineering Director and the value stream teams that build and run the Ockto platform. They operate the technical controls as the first line; you set the requirements, verify and challenge as the second.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Outside Ockto, you work with the security, risk and procurement teams of our clients and with our external auditors. For audits you are the first line of planning, execution and communication with the auditor(s). Together with the Product &amp; Trust Director, you are Ockto's security contact for DNB and AFM.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <h2>What you bring</h2><p class="MsoNormal">You combine depth in security with the judgement to apply it pragmatically in a scale-up. We're looking for someone who:</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Has 8+ years of experience in information security, including at least 3 years leading a security function as CISO, Head of Security or similar.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Has run an ISMS end to end and taken an organisation through ISO 27001 and SOC 2 Type II audits.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Knows regulated financial services and works comfortably with DORA, PSD2, GDPR and supervision by DNB or AFM.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Has solid grounding in cloud security, preferably AWS, and enough technical understanding to challenge engineers and judge designs.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Thinks in risk: turns threats into priorities, and weighs security against cost and delivery speed.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Communicates clearly at every level, from the management team and auditors to developers and a client's security officer.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Is independent and principled: comfortable saying no, and good at finding the route to yes.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Speaks and writes English fluently; Dutch is a strong advantage.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Will be a plus:</strong></p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; CISSP, CISM, CCSP or ISO 27001 Lead Auditor or Lead Implementer certification.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experience with privacy governance and DPIAs.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experience leading incident response, including notification to regulators.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experience with third-party risk management and assurance reporting such as ISAE 3402 or ISAE 3000.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Familiarity with digital identity, eIDAS2 and EU digital identity wallets.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experience governing the safe use of AI tooling in a data-sensitive environment.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h2>What you get</h2><p class="MsoNormal">You get a role with real influence on how far clients, supervisors and consumers can trust Ockto.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>Ownership</strong> of security at a company where assurance is one of the reasons clients choose us.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>A real mandate</strong>: a direct line to the CEO on security matters, a voice early in product and architecture decisions, and the final word on accepting serious security risk.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>Influence on what we build next</strong>, as Ockto grows into new markets and propositions.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>Short lines</strong> and room to shape the security function the way it should work.</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>Experienced colleagues</strong> across product, engineering and compliance.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Ockto also offers:</strong></p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; A good salary: between €5500,- and €6800,- per month, depending on experience</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Room and budget for personal and professional development</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; A MacBook Pro and smartphone of choice</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Phone and travel allowance</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Great home and remote working facilities</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Lunch fee</p><p class="MsoListParagraph">•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Plenty of activities, including our annual ski trip, a 1.5-day team offsite, drinks and team outings</p><p class="MsoNormal">You'll join a team that values diversity and collaboration, in a friendly, ambitious and innovative atmosphere.</p><p><